    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15g",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15G Objects of Part",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15g"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.17",
      "values:originalText": "The main objects of this Part are:\n\n(a) to provide for the authorisation, conduct and monitoring of\ncontrolled operations; and\n\n(b) to exempt from criminal liability, and to indemnify from civil\nliability:\n\n(i) law enforcement officers who, in the course of a\ncontrolled operation authorised under this Part, take an\nactive part in, or are otherwise involved in, the\ncommission of a Commonwealth offence or an offence\nagainst a law of a State or Territory or conduct that may\nresult in a civil liability; and\n\n(ii) certain other persons who, in accordance with the\ninstructions of a law enforcement officer and in the\ncourse of a controlled operation authorised under this\nPart, take an active part in, or are otherwise involved in,\nthe commission of a Commonwealth offence or an\noffence against a law of a State or Territory or conduct\nthat may result in a civil liability.",
      "skos:definition": "The main objects of this Part are:\n\n(a) to provide for the authorisation, conduct and monitoring of\ncontrolled operations; and\n\n(b) to exempt from criminal liability, and to indemnify from civil\nliability:\n\n(i) law enforcement officers who, in the course of a\ncontrolled operation authorised under this Part, take an\nactive part in, or are otherwise involved in, the\ncommission of a Commonwealth offence or an offence\nagainst a law of a State or Territory or conduct that may\nresult in a civil liability; and\n\n(ii) certain other persons who, in accordance with the\ninstructions of a law enforcement officer and in the\ncourse of a controlled operation authorised under this\nPart, take an active part in, or are otherwise involved in,\nthe commission of a Commonwealth offence or an\noffence against a law of a State or Territory or conduct\nthat may result in a civil liability.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15g-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15g-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15g-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15g-logic-argumentation-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15g-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15g-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "77b795c769cab3309be0a4a01dfeeb1a4cef938128620ab6e75fa033ec74689e",
      "skos:note": "Exempts law enforcement officers and certain other persons from criminal liability and civil liability in the course of a controlled operation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15g",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15G Objects of Part",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 17,
      "values:originalText": "The main objects of this Part are:\n\n(a) to provide for the authorisation, conduct and monitoring of\ncontrolled operations; and\n\n(b) to exempt from criminal liability, and to indemnify from civil\nliability:\n\n(i) law enforcement officers who, in the course of a\ncontrolled operation authorised under this Part, take an\nactive part in, or are otherwise involved in, the\ncommission of a Commonwealth offence or an offence\nagainst a law of a State or Territory or conduct that may\nresult in a civil liability; and\n\n(ii) certain other persons who, in accordance with the\ninstructions of a law enforcement officer and in the\ncourse of a controlled operation authorised under this\nPart, take an active part in, or are otherwise involved in,\nthe commission of a Commonwealth offence or an\noffence against a law of a State or Territory or conduct\nthat may result in a civil liability."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15g-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15g"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15g-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Exemption",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Exempts individuals from liability",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Law enforcement officers and certain other persons are involved in the commission of an offence.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "They are exempt from criminal liability and civil liability."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15g-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Overlaps",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The exemption applies to the course of a controlled operation",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The text mentions a 'controlled operation'",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The exemption overlaps with the course of this operation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15g-logic-argumentation-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Argumentation"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Implication",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The exemption implies that law enforcement officers and certain other persons are involved in the commission of an offence",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::argumentation",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Law enforcement officers and certain other persons take an active part in, or are otherwise involved in, the commission of a Commonwealth offence.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "They must be involved in the commission of an offence to be exempt from liability."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15g-logic-diffusion-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Diffusion"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Propagation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The exemption propagates to all individuals within the controlled operation",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::diffusion",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The text defines a 'controlled operation'",
      "cml:conclusionText": "All individuals within this operation are exempt from liability."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15g-logic-cogai-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:CogAI"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Inference",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The exemption can be inferred from the definition of a controlled operation",
      "cml:executionSurface": "sparql_library::parsers::chk_parser",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The text defines a 'controlled operation'",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Exemption is implied by this definition."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ga",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15GA Relationship to other laws and matters",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15ga"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.17",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to subsection (2) and section 15HZ, this Part is not\nintended to limit a discretion that a court has:\n\n(a) to admit or exclude evidence in any proceedings; or\n\n(b) to stay criminal proceedings in the interests of justice.\n\n(2) In determining whether evidence should be admitted or excluded in\nany proceedings, the fact that the evidence was obtained as a result\nof a person engaging in criminal activity is to be disregarded if:\n\n(a) both:\n\n\nPart IAB  Controlled operations",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Subject to subsection (2) and section 15HZ, this Part is not\nintended to limit a discretion that a court has:\n\n(a) to admit or exclude evidence in any proceedings; or\n\n(b) to stay criminal proceedings in the interests of justice.\n\n(2) In determining whether evidence should be admitted or excluded in\nany proceedings, the fact that the evidence was obtained as a result\nof a person engaging in criminal activity is to be disregarded if:\n\n(a) both:\n\n\nPart IAB  Controlled operations",
