      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "(3) A nomination ceases to have effect if:\n\n\nControlled operations  Part IAB\nPreliminary  Division 1\n\nSection 15GG\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(a) the nominated Tribunal member ceases to hold an\nappointment described in subsection (1); or\n\n(b) the ART Minister, by writing, withdraws the nomination.",
