    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15hd-ss-3-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "recklessness",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Reckless behavior",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) the person is aware of a substantial risk...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the person is reckless about the existence..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15hd-ss-3-logic-epistemic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Epistemic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "awareness",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Aware of substantial risk",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::epistemic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) the person is aware of a substantial risk...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the person is aware of the variation or cancellation..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15hd-ss-3-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "trace",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Unjustifiable to take risk",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) having regard to the circumstances known to the person, it is unjustifiable to take the risk that the authority has not been varied or cancelled.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the person takes the risk"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15hd-ss-3-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to avoid risk",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) having regard to the circumstances known to the person, it is unjustifiable to take the risk that the authority has not been varied or cancelled.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the person must avoid taking the risk"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15hd-ss-3-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "duty",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Duty to avoid risk",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) having regard to the circumstances known to the person, it is unjustifiable to take the risk that the authority has not been varied or cancelled.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the person has a duty to avoid taking the risk"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15hd-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15HD(4) Effect of being unaware of variation or cancellation of",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15hd-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.54",
      "values:originalText": "(4) In this section, a reference to an authority that is cancelled\nincludes, in the case of an integrity testing controlled operation\nauthority, a reference to an authority that has stopped being in\neffect because the integrity testing authority concerned has stopped\nbeing in effect.\nNote:\nSee paragraph 15GN(3)(c).",
      "skos:definition": "(4) In this section, a reference to an authority that is cancelled\nincludes, in the case of an integrity testing controlled operation\nauthority, a reference to an authority that has stopped being in\neffect because the integrity testing authority concerned has stopped\nbeing in effect.\nNote:\nSee paragraph 15GN(3)(c).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15hd"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15hd-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15hd-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15hd-ss-4-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "22792e9edfb577d4e0e3da25be31992ad45cd813e19ffaa95441855a97b49954",
      "skos:note": "A reference to a cancelled authority includes a reference to an authority that has stopped being in effect."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15hd-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15HD(4) Effect of being unaware of variation or cancellation of",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 54,
      "values:originalText": "(4) In this section, a reference to an authority that is cancelled\nincludes, in the case of an integrity testing controlled operation\nauthority, a reference to an authority that has stopped being in\neffect because the integrity testing authority concerned has stopped\nbeing in effect.\nNote:\nSee paragraph 15GN(3)(c)."
    },
    {
