    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15hf",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15HF Compensation for property loss or serious damage",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15hf"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.56",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If a person suffers loss of or serious damage to property, or\npersonal injury, in the course of, or as a direct result of a controlled\noperation authorised under this Part, the Commonwealth is liable to\npay to the person compensation as agreed between the\nCommonwealth and the person or, in default of agreement, as\ndetermined by action against the Commonwealth in a court of\ncompetent jurisdiction.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) does not apply if:\n\n(a) the person suffered the loss, damage or injury in the course\nof, or as a direct result of, engaging in any criminal activity\n(other than criminal activity that is controlled conduct); or\n\n(b) the person was a law enforcement participant at the time of\nsuffering the loss, damage or injury.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If a person suffers loss of or serious damage to property, or\npersonal injury, in the course of, or as a direct result of a controlled\noperation authorised under this Part, the Commonwealth is liable to\npay to the person compensation as agreed between the\nCommonwealth and the person or, in default of agreement, as\ndetermined by action against the Commonwealth in a court of\ncompetent jurisdiction.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) does not apply if:\n\n(a) the person suffered the loss, damage or injury in the course\nof, or as a direct result of, engaging in any criminal activity\n(other than criminal activity that is controlled conduct); or\n\n(b) the person was a law enforcement participant at the time of\nsuffering the loss, damage or injury.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15hf-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15hf-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2689b34048cb2fbb1e3f62a92813eee4635964bf2da94267359f503c4b96f089"
    },
