      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.76",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Ombudsman may, by writing given to the law enforcement\nofficer, require the officer to attend:\n\n(a) before a specified inspecting officer; and\n\n(b) at a specified place; and\n\n(c) within a specified period or at a specified time on a specified\nday;\nto answer questions relevant to the inspection.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Ombudsman may, by writing given to the law enforcement\nofficer, require the officer to attend:\n\n(a) before a specified inspecting officer; and\n\n(b) at a specified place; and\n\n(c) within a specified period or at a specified time on a specified\nday;\nto answer questions relevant to the inspection.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ht"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
