    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15hx",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15HX Delegation by Ombudsman",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15hx"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.80",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Ombudsman may, by written instrument, delegate to an APS\nemployee responsible to the Ombudsman all or any of the\nOmbudsman’s powers under this Division, other than a power to\nreport to the Minister.\n\n\nControlled operations  Part IAB\nCompliance and monitoring  Division 4\n\nSection 15HY\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(2) A delegate must, upon request by a person affected by the exercise\nof any power delegated to the delegate, produce the instrument of\ndelegation, or a copy of the instrument, for inspection by the\nperson.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Ombudsman may, by written instrument, delegate to an APS\nemployee responsible to the Ombudsman all or any of the\nOmbudsman’s powers under this Division, other than a power to\nreport to the Minister.\n\n\nControlled operations  Part IAB\nCompliance and monitoring  Division 4\n\nSection 15HY\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(2) A delegate must, upon request by a person affected by the exercise\nof any power delegated to the delegate, produce the instrument of\ndelegation, or a copy of the instrument, for inspection by the\nperson.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15hx-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15hx-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5d4ce036f2bac7a48486bf14eb2049e7f0c3215345519b3dfea06c29a5e004d3"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15hx",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15HX Delegation by Ombudsman",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 80,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Ombudsman may, by written instrument, delegate to an APS\nemployee responsible to the Ombudsman all or any of the\nOmbudsman’s powers under this Division, other than a power to\nreport to the Minister.\n\n\nControlled operations  Part IAB\nCompliance and monitoring  Division 4\n\nSection 15HY\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(2) A delegate must, upon request by a person affected by the exercise\nof any power delegated to the delegate, produce the instrument of\ndelegation, or a copy of the instrument, for inspection by the\nperson."
    },
