      "values:originalText": "(1) The following table has effect:\n\nIntegrity testing—circumstances in which applications may be made\nItem\nIf a proposed\nintegrity testing\noperation is\nconcerned with …\na staff member of the\nfollowing agency may\napply for authority for\nthe operation …\nfrom the following\nofficer (an\nappropriate\nauthorising officer)\n…\nthe integrity of a staff\nmember of the ACC\nthe ACC\n(a) the Chief\nExecutive Officer\nof the ACC; or\n(b) an SES employee\nin the ACC.\nthe integrity of a staff\nmember of the\nAustralian Federal\nPolice\nthe Australian Federal\nPolice\n(a) the\nCommissioner; or\n(b) a Deputy\nCommissioner; or\n(c) an SES employee\nin the Australian\nFederal Police.\nthe integrity of a staff\nmember of the\nImmigration and\nBorder Protection\nDepartment\nthe Immigration and\nBorder Protection\nDepartment\n(a) the Secretary of\nthe Immigration\nand Border\nProtection\nDepartment; or\n(b) an SES employee\nin the\nImmigration and\nBorder Protection\nDepartment.\n\n\nIntegrity testing  Part IABA\nIntegrity testing operations: authority  Division 2\n\nSection 15JE\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nIntegrity testing—circumstances in which applications may be made\nItem\nIf a proposed\nintegrity testing\noperation is\nconcerned with …\na staff member of the\nfollowing agency may\napply for authority for\nthe operation …\nfrom the following\nofficer (an\nappropriate\nauthorising officer)\n…\na corruption\ninvestigation that\nrelates to a staff\nmember of a target\nagency\n(a) the National\nAnti-Corruption\nCommission; or\n(b) if the corruption issue\nbeing investigated\nrelates to a staff\nmember of the\nACC—the ACC; or\n(c) if the corruption issue\nbeing investigated\nrelates to a staff\nmember of the\nAustralian Federal\nPolice—the\nAustralian Federal\nPolice; or\n(d) if the corruption issue\nbeing investigated\nrelates to a staff\nmember of the\nImmigration and\nBorder Protection\nDepartment—that\nDepartmen