    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15je-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15JE(2) Integrity testing authorities—circumstances in which",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 88,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The application of item 4 of the table in subsection (1) in relation\nto a staff member of the ACC, the Australian Federal Police or the\nImmigration and Border Protection Department does not prevent\nthe application of any of the other items in the table in relation to\nthe integrity of the staff member.\n\n\nPart IABA  Integrity testing"
    },
    {
