        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e39a9ff181208ad92607f11900a103746184f6538db334a9fc7443d790e2d58e",
      "skos:note": "Granting authority for integrity testing authorities"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15jg-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15JG(4) Integrity testing authorities—grant",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 90,
      "values:originalText": "(4) An integrity testing authority is not a legislative instrument.\nNote:\nSee the table in section 15JE for who are the appropriate authorising\nofficers for a proposed integrity testing operation in relation to a target\nagency."
    },
    {
