      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.91",
      "values:originalText": "Contents of integrity testing authority\n\n(1) An integrity testing authority must:\n\n(a) state the name and rank or position of the appropriate\nauthorising officer; and\n\n\nPart IABA  Integrity testing",
      "skos:definition": "Contents of integrity testing authority\n\n(1) An integrity testing authority must:\n\n(a) state the name and rank or position of the appropriate\nauthorising officer; and\n\n\nPart IABA  Integrity testing",
