    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15jk",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15JK Integrity testing authorities—variation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15jk"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.93",
      "values:originalText": "(1) An appropriate authorising officer for an integrity testing operation\nthat is authorised by an integrity testing authority may, in writing,\nvary the authority:\n\n(a) at any time on the authorising officer’s own initiative; or\n\n(b) on application, in writing, by the responsible staff member\nfor the operation.\n\n(2) A variation may extend, or further extend, the period of effect of\nthe authority for up to 12 months, but not so that the period of\neffect ends more than 24 months after the authority was granted.\n\n(3) As soon as practicable after varying an integrity testing authority\nfor an integrity testing operation, the authorising officer must give\na copy of the variation to:\n\n\nPart IABA  Integrity testing",
      "skos:definition": "(1) An appropriate authorising officer for an integrity testing operation\nthat is authorised by an integrity testing authority may, in writing,\nvary the authority:\n\n(a) at any time on the authorising officer’s own initiative; or\n\n(b) on application, in writing, by the responsible staff member\nfor the operation.\n\n(2) A variation may extend, or further extend, the period of effect of\nthe authority for up to 12 months, but not so that the period of\neffect ends more than 24 months after the authority was granted.\n\n(3) As soon as practicable after varying an integrity testing authority\nfor an integrity testing operation, the authorising officer must give\na copy of the variation to:\n\n\nPart IABA  Integrity testing",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15jk-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15jk-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15jk-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "407679336fd7c11c73889398cfc798cc47a27c31250169987e33ff74d02684db"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15jk",
