      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.94",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Cancellation of an integrity testing authority takes effect at the time\nthe order is made or at a later time stated in the order.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Cancellation of an integrity testing authority takes effect at the time\nthe order is made or at a later time stated in the order.",
      "values:partOf": {
