    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15js-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15JS(2) Integrity testing operations—annual reports",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15js-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.102",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The details to be set out in the report are as follows:\n\n(a) the number of integrity testing authorities granted by\nauthorising officers of the agency;\n\n(b) the nature of the suspected criminal activity in relation to\nwhich each authority was given;\n\n(c) the period of effect of each authority (including any\nextension of the period granted by variation);\n\n(d) if an authority was cancelled—the reasons for cancellation.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The details to be set out in the report are as follows:\n\n(a) the number of integrity testing authorities granted by\nauthorising officers of the agency;\n\n(b) the nature of the suspected criminal activity in relation to\nwhich each authority was given;\n\n(c) the period of effect of each authority (including any\nextension of the period granted by variation);\n\n(d) if an authority was cancelled—the reasons for cancellation.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15js"
      },
