    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15js-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15JS(4) Integrity testing operations—annual reports",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15js-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.102",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Nothing in this section requires particulars of an integrity testing\noperation to be included in a report for a year if the operation had\nnot been completed as at 30 June in that year, but the particulars\nmust instead be included in the report for the year in which the\noperation is completed.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Nothing in this section requires particulars of an integrity testing\noperation to be included in a report for a year if the operation had\nnot been completed as at 30 June in that year, but the particulars\nmust instead be included in the report for the year in which the\noperation is completed.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15js"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15js-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15js-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "037fe09c412b1fd64343253a218c46eab34ff0c1febbf9bbc02979c7d2178e7e",
      "skos:note": "Annual report must include particulars of an integrity testing operation if completed by the end of the year.",
      "dc:description": "Particulars of an integrity testing operation"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15js-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15JS(4) Integrity testing operations—annual reports",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 102,
      "values:originalText": "(4) Nothing in this section requires particulars of an integrity testing\noperation to be included in a report for a year if the operation had\nnot been completed as at 30 June in that year, but the particulars\nmust instead be included in the report for the year in which the\noperation is completed."
    },
