      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "048a6ffdfe486ddd9efe4fc988cf1e1198b5729f96e6b32382952d17d9730395",
      "skos:note": "Authority to acquire or use assumed identity"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15ka-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15KA(3) Application for authority to acquire or use assumed identity",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 111,
      "values:originalText": "(3) An intelligence officer of an intelligence agency may apply to the\nchief officer of the agency for an authority for the officer or any\nother person (including a foreign officer) to do either or both of the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) acquire an assumed identity;\n\n(b) use an assumed identity."
    },
