      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.111",
      "values:originalText": "(4) A separate application must be made in respect of each assumed\nidentity to be acquired or used.\n\n\nPart IAC  Assumed Identities",
      "skos:definition": "(4) A separate application must be made in respect of each assumed\nidentity to be acquired or used.\n\n\nPart IAC  Assumed Identities",
