      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 118,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the chief officer is satisfied on a review that use of the assumed\nidentity under the authority is no longer necessary, he or she must\ncancel the authority under section 15KE."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15kf-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
