      "values:originalText": "(2) The chief officer of a law enforcement agency or an intelligence\nagency (other than the Office of National Intelligence or the\nAustralian Signals Directorate) must apply for an order under the\ncorresponding assumed identity law to cancel the entry within 28\ndays after the day the authority ceases to be in force.\n\n\nPart IAC  Assumed Identities",
