    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15kn",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15KN Protection from criminal liability—officers of issuing agencies",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15kn"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.122",
      "values:originalText": "The chief officer, or an officer, of an issuing agency who does\nsomething that, apart from this section, would be a Commonwealth\noffence or an offence against a law of a State or Territory, is not\ncriminally responsible for the offence if the thing is done to\ncomply with a request under section 15KI or a direction under\nsection 15KL.",
      "skos:definition": "The chief officer, or an officer, of an issuing agency who does\nsomething that, apart from this section, would be a Commonwealth\noffence or an offence against a law of a State or Territory, is not\ncriminally responsible for the offence if the thing is done to\ncomply with a request under section 15KI or a direction under\nsection 15KL.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15kn-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15kn-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d1a96bd73cebd41654d1462876f24377daa68a53d81fea9951c573421a58959c",
      "skos:note": "Protection from criminal liability for officers of issuing agencies"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15kn",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15KN Protection from criminal liability—officers of issuing agencies",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 122,
      "values:originalText": "The chief officer, or an officer, of an issuing agency who does\nsomething that, apart from this section, would be a Commonwealth\noffence or an offence against a law of a State or Territory, is not\ncriminally responsible for the offence if the thing is done to\ncomply with a request under section 15KI or a direction under\nsection 15KL."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15kn-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15kn"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15kn-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Imposes obligation on the state to protect officers from criminal liability",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ko",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15KO Indemnity for issuing agencies and officers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15ko"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.122",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if the chief officer of either a law enforcement\nagency or an intelligence agency makes a request under\nsection 15KI or gives a direction under section 15KL to the chief\nofficer of an issuing agency.\n\n\nAssumed Identities  Part IAC\nEvidence of Assumed Identity  Division 3\n\nSection 15KO\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(2) The Commonwealth must indemnify the issuing agency, or an\nofficer of the issuing agency, for any liability incurred by the\nagency or officer (including reasonable costs) if:\n\n(a) the liability is incurred because of something done by the\nagency or officer in the course of duty to comply with the\nrequest or direction in the course of duty; and\n\n(b) any requirements prescribed under the regulations have been\nmet.\n\n\nPart IAC  Assumed Identities",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if the chief officer of either a law enforcement\nagency or an intelligence agency makes a request under\nsection 15KI or gives a direction under section 15KL to the chief\nofficer of an issuing agency.\n\n\nAssumed Identities  Part IAC\nEvidence of Assumed Identity  Division 3\n\nSection 15KO\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(2) The Commonwealth must indemnify the issuing agency, or an\nofficer of the issuing agency, for any liability incurred by the\nagency or officer (including reasonable costs) if:\n\n(a) the liability is incurred because of something done by the\nagency or officer in the course of duty to comply with the\nrequest or direction in the course of duty; and\n\n(b) any requirements prescribed under the regulations have been\nmet.\n\n\nPart IAC  Assumed Identities",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ko-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ko-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0c2706eb6a68085837738bd562896502e12b855826d34e953ac498e3d2120b07"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15ko",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15KO Indemnity for issuing agencies and officers",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 122,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if the chief officer of either a law enforcement\nagency or an intelligence agency makes a request under\nsection 15KI or gives a direction under section 15KL to the chief\nofficer of an issuing agency.\n\n\nAssumed Identities  Part IAC\nEvidence of Assumed Identity  Division 3\n\nSection 15KO\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(2) The Commonwealth must indemnify the issuing agency, or an\nofficer of the issuing agency, for any liability incurred by the\nagency or officer (including reasonable costs) if:\n\n(a) the liability is incurred because of something done by the\nagency or officer in the course of duty to comply with the\nrequest or direction in the course of duty; and\n\n(b) any requirements prescribed under the regulations have been\nmet.\n\n\nPart IAC  Assumed Identities"
    },
    {
