    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ko-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15KO(2) Indemnity for issuing agencies and officers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15ko-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.122",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Commonwealth must indemnify the issuing agency, or an\nofficer of the issuing agency, for any liability incurred by the\nagency or officer (including reasonable costs) if:\n\n(a) the liability is incurred because of something done by the\nagency or officer in the course of duty to comply with the\nrequest or direction in the course of duty; and\n\n(b) any requirements prescribed under the regulations have been\nmet.\n\n\nPart IAC  Assumed Identities",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Commonwealth must indemnify the issuing agency, or an\nofficer of the issuing agency, for any liability incurred by the\nagency or officer (including reasonable costs) if:\n\n(a) the liability is incurred because of something done by the\nagency or officer in the course of duty to comply with the\nrequest or direction in the course of duty; and\n\n(b) any requirements prescribed under the regulations have been\nmet.\n\n\nPart IAC  Assumed Identities",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ko"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ko-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ko-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3c333ba937156289f81eae4b9b0a4225da6d9e5747474ff72f3e21fcc9df6d78",
      "skos:note": "Commonwealth must indemnify issuing agency or officer for liability incurred in course of duty to comply with request or direction."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15ko-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15KO(2) Indemnity for issuing agencies and officers",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 122,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Commonwealth must indemnify the issuing agency, or an\nofficer of the issuing agency, for any liability incurred by the\nagency or officer (including reasonable costs) if:\n\n(a) the liability is incurred because of something done by the\nagency or officer in the course of duty to comply with the\nrequest or direction in the course of duty; and\n\n(b) any requirements prescribed under the regulations have been\nmet.\n\n\nPart IAC  Assumed Identities"
    },
    {
