    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15kt",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15KT Particular qualifications",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15kt"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.126",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Sections 15KQ, 15KR and 15KS do not apply to anything done by\nan authorised person if:\n\n(a) a particular qualification is needed to do the thing; and\n\n(b) the person does not have that qualification.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) applies whether or not the person has acquired, as\nevidence of an assumed identity, a document that indicates that he\nor she has that qualification.\nExample: An officer who cannot fly a plane is not authorised to fly even though\nhe or she has acquired a pilot’s licence under an assumed identity.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Sections 15KQ, 15KR and 15KS do not apply to anything done by\nan authorised person if:\n\n(a) a particular qualification is needed to do the thing; and\n\n(b) the person does not have that qualification.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) applies whether or not the person has acquired, as\nevidence of an assumed identity, a document that indicates that he\nor she has that qualification.\nExample: An officer who cannot fly a plane is not authorised to fly even though\nhe or she has acquired a pilot’s licence under an assumed identity.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15kt-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15kt-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0f5effcefb191742d1ae2eba542a0a965f017d1d23b18caacf0ca2090b9b8b9b"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15kt",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15KT Particular qualifications",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 126,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Sections 15KQ, 15KR and 15KS do not apply to anything done by\nan authorised person if:\n\n(a) a particular qualification is needed to do the thing; and\n\n(b) the person does not have that qualification.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) applies whether or not the person has acquired, as\nevidence of an assumed identity, a document that indicates that he\nor she has that qualification.\nExample: An officer who cannot fly a plane is not authorised to fly even though\nhe or she has acquired a pilot’s licence under an assumed identity."
    },
