      "skos:note": "Chief officer of originating agency must provide written document to chief officer of receiving agency with certain information."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15kv-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
