      "skos:note": "Chief officer of receiving agency must make request under section 15KI."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15kw-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15KW(5) Consequences of transfer of control of authorities",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 128,
      "values:originalText": "(5) Section 15KL (which deals with cancellation of evidence of\nassumed identity) has effect as if the chief officer of the receiving\nagency had made the request under section 15KI.\n\n\nPart IAC  Assumed Identities"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15kw-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
