      "cml:premiseText": "(a) an authority under a corresponding assumed identity law authorises a request for...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...the giving of evidence of the assumed identity to the authorised person named in the authority;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ky-ss-2",
