    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ky-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15KY(3) Requests from a participating jurisdiction for evidence of",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15ky-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.131",
      "values:originalText": "(3) This section does not require any of the following to comply with a\nrequest made as mentioned in paragraph (1)(b):\n\n(a) the chief officer of an intelligence agency (other than the\nOffice of National Intelligence);\n\n(c) the chief officer of the Australian Geospatial-Intelligence\nOrganisation.\n\n\nPart IAC  Assumed Identities",
      "skos:definition": "(3) This section does not require any of the following to comply with a\nrequest made as mentioned in paragraph (1)(b):\n\n(a) the chief officer of an intelligence agency (other than the\nOffice of National Intelligence);\n\n(c) the chief officer of the Australian Geospatial-Intelligence\nOrganisation.\n\n\nPart IAC  Assumed Identities",
      "values:partOf": {
