      "cml:integrityHash": "d03c7fa69cd81301a8f574dde01be02a30c22da435f300c2e585318d62780524",
      "skos:note": "Exemptions from compliance with a request made under section (1)(b)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15ky-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15KY(3) Requests from a participating jurisdiction for evidence of",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 131,
      "values:originalText": "(3) This section does not require any of the following to comply with a\nrequest made as mentioned in paragraph (1)(b):\n\n(a) the chief officer of an intelligence agency (other than the\nOffice of National Intelligence);\n\n(c) the chief officer of the Australian Geospatial-Intelligence\nOrganisation.\n\n\nPart IAC  Assumed Identities"
