      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.132",
      "values:originalText": "of assumed identity\n\n(1) The chief officer of an issuing agency who produces evidence of\nan assumed identity because of a request mentioned in\nsection 15KY must cancel the evidence if directed in writing to do\nso by the chief officer who authorised the request.\n\n(2) In this section:\ncancel includes delete or alter an entry in a record of information.",
      "skos:definition": "of assumed identity\n\n(1) The chief officer of an issuing agency who produces evidence of\nan assumed identity because of a request mentioned in\nsection 15KY must cancel the evidence if directed in writing to do\nso by the chief officer who authorised the request.\n\n(2) In this section:\ncancel includes delete or alter an entry in a record of information.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15kz-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15kz-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7b2697aa7a1d19e35679f2b14364e867fcd8e3cf75859214aa350e9331c2d206"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15kz",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15KZ Directions from a participating jurisdiction to cancel evidence",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 132,
      "values:originalText": "of assumed identity\n\n(1) The chief officer of an issuing agency who produces evidence of\nan assumed identity because of a request mentioned in\nsection 15KY must cancel the evidence if directed in writing to do\nso by the chief officer who authorised the request.\n\n(2) In this section:\ncancel includes delete or alter an entry in a record of information."
    },
