      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.136",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The NACC Minister must exclude information from the report if\nsatisfied on the advice of the chief officer of any of the grounds set\nout in subsection (2) and must cause a copy of the report to be laid\nbefore each House of the Parliament within 15 sitting days of that\nHouse after the day on which the NACC Minister receives the\nreport.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The NACC Minister must exclude information from the report if\nsatisfied on the advice of the chief officer of any of the grounds set\nout in subsection (2) and must cause a copy of the report to be laid\nbefore each House of the Parliament within 15 sitting days of that\nHouse after the day on which the NACC Minister receives the\nreport.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ld"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ld-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ld-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0a915c5f3a508337f3ab7da3307496e27162d8b2ddc6721685613776ba88d47f",
      "skos:note": "Must exclude information from report if certain grounds are met and provide a copy to Parliament within 15 days.",
      "dc:description": "Report"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15ld-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15LD(3) Reports about authorities for assumed identities etc.—law",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 136,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The NACC Minister must exclude information from the report if\nsatisfied on the advice of the chief officer of any of the grounds set\nout in subsection (2) and must cause a copy of the report to be laid\nbefore each House of the Parliament within 15 sitting days of that\nHouse after the day on which the NACC Minister receives the\nreport."
    },
