    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ma",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15MA Meaning of criminal proceeding",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15ma"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.145",
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this Part, criminal proceeding means a proceeding for the\nprosecution, whether summarily or on indictment, of an offence or\noffences.\n\n(2) To avoid doubt, each of the following is part of a criminal\nproceeding:\n\n(a) a bail proceeding;\n\n\nPart IACA  Witness identity protection for operatives",
      "skos:definition": "(1) In this Part, criminal proceeding means a proceeding for the\nprosecution, whether summarily or on indictment, of an offence or\noffences.\n\n(2) To avoid doubt, each of the following is part of a criminal\nproceeding:\n\n(a) a bail proceeding;\n\n\nPart IACA  Witness identity protection for operatives",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ma-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ma-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0c6b2ac828522c4e7357adaf5dc49848369ddaacaf9b7d64b5152b498974315a"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15ma",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15MA Meaning of criminal proceeding",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 145,
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this Part, criminal proceeding means a proceeding for the\nprosecution, whether summarily or on indictment, of an offence or\noffences.\n\n(2) To avoid doubt, each of the following is part of a criminal\nproceeding:\n\n(a) a bail proceeding;\n\n\nPart IACA  Witness identity protection for operatives"
    },
