      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.148",
      "values:originalText": "(6) A witness identity protection certificate purporting to be issued\nunder subsection (1):\n\n(a) must be taken to be such a certificate and to have been\nproperly issued; and\n\n(b) is prima facie evidence of the matters in the certificate.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) A witness identity protection certificate purporting to be issued\nunder subsection (1):\n\n(a) must be taken to be such a certificate and to have been\nproperly issued; and\n\n(b) is prima facie evidence of the matters in the certificate.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15me"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15me-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15me-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ab05f6ec3df4cd29125f54f153ba8b16859178f7b3517f53dc27b4cfbc72c04b",
      "skos:note": "A witness identity protection certificate must be taken as properly issued and prima facie evidence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15me-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15ME(6) Witness identity protection certificate",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 148,
      "values:originalText": "(6) A witness identity protection certificate purporting to be issued\nunder subsection (1):\n\n(a) must be taken to be such a certificate and to have been\nproperly issued; and\n\n(b) is prima facie evidence of the matters in the certificate."
    },
