    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15mm-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15MM(4) Disclosure of operative’s identity etc. despite certificate",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15mm-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.154",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The court may do either or both of the following:\n\n(a) give leave for the party or lawyer to do anything mentioned\nin paragraph (2)(a);\n\n(b) make an order requiring a witness to do anything mentioned\nin paragraph (2)(b).",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The court may do either or both of the following:\n\n(a) give leave for the party or lawyer to do anything mentioned\nin paragraph (2)(a);\n\n(b) make an order requiring a witness to do anything mentioned\nin paragraph (2)(b).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15mm"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15mm-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15mm-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "75f9b2e7ffd23951a56c4df3f67e0b68bf00e473d6d23f42d247da36979628e3",
      "skos:note": "Court may give leave or make order for witness to do something."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15mm-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15MM(4) Disclosure of operative’s identity etc. despite certificate",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 154,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The court may do either or both of the following:\n\n(a) give leave for the party or lawyer to do anything mentioned\nin paragraph (2)(a);\n\n(b) make an order requiring a witness to do anything mentioned\nin paragraph (2)(b)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15mm-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15mm-ss-4"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
