    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15mm-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15MM(7) Disclosure of operative’s identity etc. despite certificate",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15mm-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.154",
      "values:originalText": "(7) Unless the court considers that the interests of justice require\notherwise, the court must be closed when:\n\n(a) the application is made; and\n\n(b) if leave is given or an order is made—the question is asked\n(and answered), the evidence is given, the information is\nprovided or the statement is made.\n\n\nPart IACA  Witness identity protection for operatives",
      "skos:definition": "(7) Unless the court considers that the interests of justice require\notherwise, the court must be closed when:\n\n(a) the application is made; and\n\n(b) if leave is given or an order is made—the question is asked\n(and answered), the evidence is given, the information is\nprovided or the statement is made.\n\n\nPart IACA  Witness identity protection for operatives",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15mm"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15mm-ss-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15mm-ss-7-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15mm-ss-7-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15mm-ss-7-logic-argumentation-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15mm-ss-7-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15mm-ss-7-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "176bb9b7f2ea3289b7164ec50b38569618e77baa4debc1b00cd97089366bd8dc",
      "skos:note": "Court must be closed under certain conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15mm-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15MM(7) Disclosure of operative’s identity etc. despite certificate",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 154,
      "values:originalText": "(7) Unless the court considers that the interests of justice require\notherwise, the court must be closed when:\n\n(a) the application is made; and\n\n(b) if leave is given or an order is made—the question is asked\n(and answered), the evidence is given, the information is\nprovided or the statement is made.\n\n\nPart IACA  Witness identity protection for operatives"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15mm-ss-7-norm",
