    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15mp",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15MP Appeals and adjournments",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15mp"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.157",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if, in proceedings before a court (the original\ncourt):\n\n(a) the original court gives, or refuses, leave under section 15MI\nor 15MM in relation to a witness identity protection\ncertificate for an operative; or\n\n\nPart IACA  Witness identity protection for operatives",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if, in proceedings before a court (the original\ncourt):\n\n(a) the original court gives, or refuses, leave under section 15MI\nor 15MM in relation to a witness identity protection\ncertificate for an operative; or\n\n\nPart IACA  Witness identity protection for operatives",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15mp-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15mp-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "db4ebf0be3f4fe293335ca6727b0edbe50b32f979e516e5f6cd769407e2da9e8",
      "skos:note": "Original court must give or refuse leave for witness identity protection certificate."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15mp",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15MP Appeals and adjournments",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 157,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if, in proceedings before a court (the original\ncourt):\n\n(a) the original court gives, or refuses, leave under section 15MI\nor 15MM in relation to a witness identity protection\ncertificate for an operative; or\n\n\nPart IACA  Witness identity protection for operatives"
    },
    {
