      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.161",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A chief officer of a law enforcement agency may sign a certificate\nstating any of the following:\n\n\nPart IACA  Witness identity protection for operatives",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A chief officer of a law enforcement agency may sign a certificate\nstating any of the following:\n\n\nPart IACA  Witness identity protection for operatives",
