    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ya-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15YA(1) Definitions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15ya-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.170",
      "values:originalText": "(1) In a proceeding for a Commonwealth offence, the court may\ndeclare a person to be a special witness in relation to the\nproceeding if satisfied that the person is unlikely to be able to\nsatisfactorily give evidence in the ordinary manner because of:\n\n(a) a disability; or\n\n(b) intimidation, distress or emotional trauma arising from:\n\n(i) the person’s age, cultural background or relationship to\na party to the proceeding; or\n\n(ii) the nature of the evidence; or\n\n(iii) some other relevant factor.\n\n\nPart IAD  Protecting vulnerable persons",
      "skos:definition": "(1) In a proceeding for a Commonwealth offence, the court may\ndeclare a person to be a special witness in relation to the\nproceeding if satisfied that the person is unlikely to be able to\nsatisfactorily give evidence in the ordinary manner because of:\n\n(a) a disability; or\n\n(b) intimidation, distress or emotional trauma arising from:\n\n(i) the person’s age, cultural background or relationship to\na party to the proceeding; or\n\n(ii) the nature of the evidence; or\n\n(iii) some other relevant factor.\n\n\nPart IAD  Protecting vulnerable persons",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ya"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ya-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ya-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ya-ss-1-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ya-ss-1-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ya-ss-1-logic-deontic-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ya-ss-1-logic-alleninterval-5"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ya-ss-1-logic-deontic-6"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ya-ss-1-logic-deontic-7"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "91952c9560ceda8c0f1719b232bb5ce88179e912574e5775aa901ef0a89d9529",
      "skos:note": "Defines a vulnerable adult complainant in relation to a vulnerable adult proceeding. Court may declare a person special witness if unlikely to give evidence in ordinary manner due to disability, intimidation, distress or emotional trauma."
    },
    {
