      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.174",
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of paragraph (2)(a), the evidence is not to be\ntreated as being substantially relevant to facts in issue merely\n\n\nPart IAD  Protecting vulnerable persons",
      "skos:definition": "(3) For the purposes of paragraph (2)(a), the evidence is not to be\ntreated as being substantially relevant to facts in issue merely\n\n\nPart IAD  Protecting vulnerable persons",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yc"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yc-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yc-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "49d19fbed94ef9cc97d420016dc504e1ec847d7af1fc6d95372e3ab68ea1949b",
      "skos:note": "Evidence of sexual experience is not to be treated as substantially relevant to facts in issue Do not treat evidence as substantially relevant to facts in issue merely because of inferences it may raise about the child witness' or child complainant's general disposition."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15yc-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15YC(3) Evidence of sexual experience—child proceedings",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 174,
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of paragraph (2)(a), the evidence is not to be\ntreated as being substantially relevant to facts in issue merely\n\n\nPart IAD  Protecting vulnerable persons"
    },
