    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yd",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15YD Leave under this Division",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15yd"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.176",
      "values:originalText": "(1) An application for leave under this Division:\n\n(a) must be in writing; and\n\n(b) if there is a jury in the proceeding in question—must be\nmade in the jury’s absence; and\n\n(c) must not be determined before the court has considered such\nsubmissions and other evidence as it thinks necessary for\ndetermining the application.\n\n(2) If the court gives leave under this Division, the court must:\n\n(a) state its reasons in writing; and\n\n(b) cause those reasons to be entered in the court’s records.\n\n\nProtecting vulnerable persons  Part IAD\nEvidence recording hearings  Division 2A\n\nSection 15YDA\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(1) An application for leave under this Division:\n\n(a) must be in writing; and\n\n(b) if there is a jury in the proceeding in question—must be\nmade in the jury’s absence; and\n\n(c) must not be determined before the court has considered such\nsubmissions and other evidence as it thinks necessary for\ndetermining the application.\n\n(2) If the court gives leave under this Division, the court must:\n\n(a) state its reasons in writing; and\n\n(b) cause those reasons to be entered in the court’s records.\n\n\nProtecting vulnerable persons  Part IAD\nEvidence recording hearings  Division 2A\n\nSection 15YDA\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
