      "skos:definition": "(1) A defendant in a child proceeding who is not represented by\ncounsel is not to cross-examine a child complainant.\nNote:\nA person is not to cross-examine certain persons at committal\nproceedings or proceedings of a similar kind—see section 15YHA.",
