      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.186",
      "values:originalText": "(3) This section does not affect the operation of any law in relation to\nthe competence of a person to give evidence.\n\n\nProtecting vulnerable persons  Part IAD\nSpecial facilities for vulnerable persons to give evidence  Division 4\n\nSection 15YJ\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(3) This section does not affect the operation of any law in relation to\nthe competence of a person to give evidence.\n\n\nProtecting vulnerable persons  Part IAD\nSpecial facilities for vulnerable persons to give evidence  Division 4\n\nSection 15YJ\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
