      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yk",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15YK Viewing evidence given by closed-circuit television",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15yk"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.187",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If the vulnerable person’s evidence is given by means of\nclosed-circuit television, the facilities used are to be operated in\nsuch a way that the people who have an interest in the proceeding\ncan see the vulnerable person, and any person present with the\nvulnerable person, on one or more television monitors.\n\n(2) The following must be allowed to see the vulnerable person, and\nany person present with the vulnerable person, on one or more\ntelevision monitors while the evidence is given:\n\n(a) a defendant and the defendant’s legal representative (if any);\n\n(b) if there is a jury in the proceeding—the members of the jury.\n\n\nPart IAD  Protecting vulnerable persons",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If the vulnerable person’s evidence is given by means of\nclosed-circuit television, the facilities used are to be operated in\nsuch a way that the people who have an interest in the proceeding\ncan see the vulnerable person, and any person present with the\nvulnerable person, on one or more television monitors.\n\n(2) The following must be allowed to see the vulnerable person, and\nany person present with the vulnerable person, on one or more\ntelevision monitors while the evidence is given:\n\n(a) a defendant and the defendant’s legal representative (if any);\n\n(b) if there is a jury in the proceeding—the members of the jury.\n\n\nPart IAD  Protecting vulnerable persons",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yk-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yk-ss-2"
        }
      ],
