      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 187,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The following must be allowed to see the vulnerable person, and\nany person present with the vulnerable person, on one or more\ntelevision monitors while the evidence is given:\n\n(a) a defendant and the defendant’s legal representative (if any);\n\n(b) if there is a jury in the proceeding—the members of the jury.\n\n\nPart IAD  Protecting vulnerable persons"
    },
