      "skos:definition": "(2) The arrangements may include either of the following:\n\n(a) using screens;\n\n(b) planning seating arrangements for people who have an\ninterest in the proceeding, including:\n\n(i) the level at which they are seated; and\n\n(ii) the people in the person’s line of vision.\nPersons to whom these alternative arrangements apply",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yl"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yl-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yl-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6cb48ca1855a26d0dc1ca8fd0f3d9a1ae20cfb064ed9e7939ba0b449dcefbe6a",
      "skos:note": "Alternative arrangements for giving evidence may include planning seating arrangements. Specifies persons subject to this subsection"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15yl-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15YL(2) Alternative arrangements for giving evidence",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 188,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The arrangements may include either of the following:\n\n(a) using screens;\n\n(b) planning seating arrangements for people who have an\ninterest in the proceeding, including:\n\n(i) the level at which they are seated; and\n\n(ii) the people in the person’s line of vision.\nPersons to whom these alternative arrangements apply"
    },
