      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ys",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15YS General powers of a court",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15ys"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.200",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The power of a court to control the conduct of a proceeding is not\naffected by this Part, except so far as this Part provides otherwise\nexpressly or by necessary intendment.\n\n(2) In particular, the powers of a court to control the questioning of\nwitnesses are not affected.\n\n\nProtecting vulnerable persons  Part IAD\nMiscellaneous  Division 6\n\nSection 15YT\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(3) The power of a court to give leave under this Part includes the\npower to give such leave subject to conditions.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The power of a court to control the conduct of a proceeding is not\naffected by this Part, except so far as this Part provides otherwise\nexpressly or by necessary intendment.\n\n(2) In particular, the powers of a court to control the questioning of\nwitnesses are not affected.\n\n\nProtecting vulnerable persons  Part IAD\nMiscellaneous  Division 6\n\nSection 15YT\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(3) The power of a court to give leave under this Part includes the\npower to give such leave subject to conditions.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ys-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ys-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ys-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "dd0221e918cd9fe31f230e25dd895cc31012f46075b2aa92a1ea7d5256519a5b"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15ys",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15YS General powers of a court",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 200,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The power of a court to control the conduct of a proceeding is not\naffected by this Part, except so far as this Part provides otherwise\nexpressly or by necessary intendment.\n\n(2) In particular, the powers of a court to control the questioning of\nwitnesses are not affected.\n\n\nProtecting vulnerable persons  Part IAD\nMiscellaneous  Division 6\n\nSection 15YT\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(3) The power of a court to give leave under this Part includes the\npower to give such leave subject to conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15ys-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15YS(1) General powers of a court",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15ys-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
