      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.205",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If:\n\n(a) a direction or order is in force under section 15YV; and\n\n\nPart IAE  Video link evidence in proceedings for terrorism and related offences etc.\n\nSection 15YW\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(b) the direction or order specifies a person for the purposes of\nthis section;\nthe court may vary the direction or order so as to substitute another\nspecified person.\nWho can be an observer",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If:\n\n(a) a direction or order is in force under section 15YV; and\n\n\nPart IAE  Video link evidence in proceedings for terrorism and related offences etc.\n\nSection 15YW\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(b) the direction or order specifies a person for the purposes of\nthis section;\nthe court may vary the direction or order so as to substitute another\nspecified person.\nWho can be an observer",
