      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.205",
      "values:originalText": "(4) A person specified for the purposes of this section may be:\n\n(a) an Australian diplomatic officer; or\n\n(b) an Australian consular officer; or\n\n(c) any other person.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) A person specified for the purposes of this section may be:\n\n(a) an Australian diplomatic officer; or\n\n(b) an Australian consular officer; or\n\n(c) any other person.",
