    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15YW(5) Observers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15yw-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.205",
      "values:originalText": "(5) The court must not specify a person for the purposes of this section\nunless the court is satisfied that the person is:\n\n(a) independent of the prosecutor; and\n\n(b) independent of each defendant in the proceeding; and\n\n(c) in a position to give a report to the court about what the\nperson observes in relation to the giving of evidence by the\nwitness; and\n\n(d) reasonably available to observe the giving of evidence by the\nwitness; and\n\n(e) an appropriate person to be specified for the purposes of this\nsection.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) The court must not specify a person for the purposes of this section\nunless the court is satisfied that the person is:\n\n(a) independent of the prosecutor; and\n\n(b) independent of each defendant in the proceeding; and\n\n(c) in a position to give a report to the court about what the\nperson observes in relation to the giving of evidence by the\nwitness; and\n\n(d) reasonably available to observe the giving of evidence by the\nwitness; and\n\n(e) an appropriate person to be specified for the purposes of this\nsection.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-5-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-5-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-5-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0c88294d7ae24f916961f46b0e50e6562c79fa93bdbde11bdc0df2c930de41cd",
      "skos:note": "Court must grant adjournment if application is made under this section. Court must ensure observer is independent of prosecutor and defendants."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15yw-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15YW(5) Observers",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 205,
      "values:originalText": "(5) The court must not specify a person for the purposes of this section\nunless the court is satisfied that the person is:\n\n(a) independent of the prosecutor; and\n\n(b) independent of each defendant in the proceeding; and\n\n(c) in a position to give a report to the court about what the\nperson observes in relation to the giving of evidence by the\nwitness; and\n\n(d) reasonably available to observe the giving of evidence by the\nwitness; and\n\n(e) an appropriate person to be specified for the purposes of this\nsection."
    },
    {
