    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15YW(7) Observers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15yw-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.205",
      "values:originalText": "(7) If:\n\n(a) a direction or order is in force under section 15YV; and\n\n(b) the direction or order specifies a person for the purposes of\nthis section;\nthe court may:\n\n(c) direct or allow the specified person to give the court a report,\nin such form and by such time as the court requires, about\n\n\nVideo link evidence in proceedings for terrorism and related offences etc.  Part IAE\n\nSection 15YX\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nwhat the person observed in relation to the giving of evidence\nby the witness; and\n\n(d) make such use of the report as the court considers appropriate\nfor the purpose of deciding whether evidence given by the\nwitness under the section 15YV direction or order should be\nadmitted as evidence in the proceeding.\nDefinitions",
      "skos:definition": "(7) If:\n\n(a) a direction or order is in force under section 15YV; and\n\n(b) the direction or order specifies a person for the purposes of\nthis section;\nthe court may:\n\n(c) direct or allow the specified person to give the court a report,\nin such form and by such time as the court requires, about\n\n\nVideo link evidence in proceedings for terrorism and related offences etc.  Part IAE\n\nSection 15YX\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nwhat the person observed in relation to the giving of evidence\nby the witness; and\n\n(d) make such use of the report as the court considers appropriate\nfor the purpose of deciding whether evidence given by the\nwitness under the section 15YV direction or order should be\nadmitted as evidence in the proceeding.\nDefinitions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-7-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-7-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-7-logic-argumentation-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a1439418cfbf3b5d3d471cfc40f4098defa5d2846b001d46db81737024ae7c3e",
      "skos:note": "Court may direct or allow specified person to provide report about video link evidence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15yw-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15YW(7) Observers",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 205,
      "values:originalText": "(7) If:\n\n(a) a direction or order is in force under section 15YV; and\n\n(b) the direction or order specifies a person for the purposes of\nthis section;\nthe court may:\n\n(c) direct or allow the specified person to give the court a report,\nin such form and by such time as the court requires, about\n\n\nVideo link evidence in proceedings for terrorism and related offences etc.  Part IAE\n\nSection 15YX\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nwhat the person observed in relation to the giving of evidence\nby the witness; and\n\n(d) make such use of the report as the court considers appropriate\nfor the purpose of deciding whether evidence given by the\nwitness under the section 15YV direction or order should be\nadmitted as evidence in the proceeding.\nDefinitions"
    },
