      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.205",
      "values:originalText": "(8) In this section:\nAustralian consular officer has the same meaning as in the\nConsular Fees Act 1955.\nAustralian diplomatic officer has the same meaning as in the\nConsular Fees Act 1955.\n15YX  Adjournment after a section 15YV direction or order etc.\nCourt gives a direction or makes an order",
      "skos:definition": "(8) In this section:\nAustralian consular officer has the same meaning as in the\nConsular Fees Act 1955.\nAustralian diplomatic officer has the same meaning as in the\nConsular Fees Act 1955.\n15YX  Adjournment after a section 15YV direction or order etc.\nCourt gives a direction or makes an order",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-8-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a225addcdfdac91ada3c1d4b4166c72f6b887f752ce708c03df8a8295ac419d0",
      "skos:note": "Court must give direction or make order"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15yw-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15YW(8) Observers",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 205,
      "values:originalText": "(8) In this section:\nAustralian consular officer has the same meaning as in the\nConsular Fees Act 1955.\nAustralian diplomatic officer has the same meaning as in the\nConsular Fees Act 1955.\n15YX  Adjournment after a section 15YV direction or order etc.\nCourt gives a direction or makes an order"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-8-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
