    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15YW(1) Observers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15yw-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.205",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n\n(a) a court gives a section 15YV direction or makes a\nsection 15YV order; and\n\n(b) the prosecutor applied for the direction or order;\na defendant in the proceeding may apply to the court for an\nadjournment of the proceeding to allow time for the defendant to:\n\n(c) decide whether to appeal against the direction or order; and\n\n(d) if the defendant decides to do so—make the appeal.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If:\n\n(a) a court gives a section 15YV direction or makes a\nsection 15YV order; and\n\n(b) the prosecutor applied for the direction or order;\na defendant in the proceeding may apply to the court for an\nadjournment of the proceeding to allow time for the defendant to:\n\n(c) decide whether to appeal against the direction or order; and\n\n(d) if the defendant decides to do so—make the appeal.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "15874de2e7e34d02198c2dd8edd175bac72861af70826db602c74173942e7d10",
      "skos:note": "Defendant may appeal against court direction or order. Witness must be physically present at the place of evidence giving."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15yw-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15YW(1) Observers",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 205,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n\n(a) a court gives a section 15YV direction or makes a\nsection 15YV order; and\n\n(b) the prosecutor applied for the direction or order;\na defendant in the proceeding may apply to the court for an\nadjournment of the proceeding to allow time for the defendant to:\n\n(c) decide whether to appeal against the direction or order; and\n\n(d) if the defendant decides to do so—make the appeal."
    },
    {
