      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.205",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If an application is made under this section, the court must grant\nthe adjournment.\nNote:\nFor appeals, see section 15YZD.\n\n\nVideo link evidence in proceedings for terrorism and related offences etc.  Part IAE\n\nSection 15YY\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If an application is made under this section, the court must grant\nthe adjournment.\nNote:\nFor appeals, see section 15YZD.\n\n\nVideo link evidence in proceedings for terrorism and related offences etc.  Part IAE\n\nSection 15YY\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-5-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-5-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-5-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d30bc11f44854a75af68e7d298053c1024e51e1c0b924fe95bf747d950d3f8e5",
      "skos:note": "Court must grant adjournment if application is made under this section. Court must ensure observer is independent of prosecutor and defendants."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15yw-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15YW(5) Observers",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 205,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If an application is made under this section, the court must grant\nthe adjournment.\nNote:\nFor appeals, see section 15YZD.\n\n\nVideo link evidence in proceedings for terrorism and related offences etc.  Part IAE\n\nSection 15YY\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
