    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-5-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Court must grant adjournment",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Application is made under this section",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Adjournment granted"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-5-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Necessity",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Court must ensure observer is independent.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(5) The court must not specify a person for the purposes of this section unless...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...the court is satisfied that the person is independent of the prosecutor and defendants."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-5-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Necessity",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Observer must be reasonably available to observe evidence giving.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(5) The court must not specify a person for the purposes of this section unless...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...the court is satisfied that the person is independent of the prosecutor and defendants, and in a position to give a report to the court about what the person observes in relation to the giving of evidence by the witness."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yw-ss-5-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Necessity",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Observer must be an appropriate person for the purposes of this section.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(5) The court must not specify a person for the purposes of this section unless...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...the court is satisfied that the person is independent of the prosecutor and defendants, in a position to give a report to the court about what the person observes in relation to the giving of evidence by the witness, and reasonably available to observe the giving of evidence by the witness."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yy",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15YY Technical requirements for video link",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15yy"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.209",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A witness can give evidence under a section 15YV direction or\norder only if:\n\n(a) the courtroom or other place where the court is sitting (the\ncourtroom point); and\n\n(b) the place where the evidence is given (the witness point);\nare equipped with video facilities that:\n\n(c) enable appropriate persons at the courtroom point to see and\nhear the witness give the evidence; and\n\n(d) enable appropriate persons at the witness point to see and\nhear appropriate persons at the courtroom point.\n\n(2) In subsection (1):\nappropriate persons means such persons as the court considers\nappropriate.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A witness can give evidence under a section 15YV direction or\norder only if:\n\n(a) the courtroom or other place where the court is sitting (the\ncourtroom point); and\n\n(b) the place where the evidence is given (the witness point);\nare equipped with video facilities that:\n\n(c) enable appropriate persons at the courtroom point to see and\nhear the witness give the evidence; and\n\n(d) enable appropriate persons at the witness point to see and\nhear appropriate persons at the courtroom point.\n\n(2) In subsection (1):\nappropriate persons means such persons as the court considers\nappropriate.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yy-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yy-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9280a0b4abf7dde1a84ace364270f24e4df7fec7f416429fb41ff13c457b65df"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15yy",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15YY Technical requirements for video link",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 209,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A witness can give evidence under a section 15YV direction or\norder only if:\n\n(a) the courtroom or other place where the court is sitting (the\ncourtroom point); and\n\n(b) the place where the evidence is given (the witness point);\nare equipped with video facilities that:\n\n(c) enable appropriate persons at the courtroom point to see and\nhear the witness give the evidence; and\n\n(d) enable appropriate persons at the witness point to see and\nhear appropriate persons at the courtroom point.\n\n(2) In subsection (1):\nappropriate persons means such persons as the court considers\nappropriate."
    },
