      "cml:premiseText": "(c) enable appropriate persons at the courtroom point to see and hear the witness give the evidence; (d) enable appropriate persons at the witness point to see and hear appropriate persons at the courtroom point."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15yy-ss-1-logic-deontic-4",
