      "cml:integrityHash": "b9e451871844fc9a2f34210272bd6a4c3b47ba3e25101b3ac6a0d389b59aa8b9",
      "skos:note": "Defendant may appeal against section 15YV direction or order. Ensure equal weight to witness evidence in jury proceedings. A person must give evidence at the courtroom or other place where the court is sitting."
    },
