      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) A person who gives evidence under a section 15YV direction or order is taken to give it at the courtroom or other place where the court is sitting.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "A person must give evidence at the courtroom or other place where the court is sitting."
    },
