      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(6) The person convicted of the offence may only test the facts in a victim impact statement:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-16ab-ss-6-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "may_only",
      "cml:logicSummary": "May only test the facts",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) by way of cross-examining the maker of the statement;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-16ab-ss-6-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "may_only",
      "cml:logicSummary": "May only test the facts",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) if the court gives leave to do so."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-16ab-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "16AB(7) Matters relating to victim impact statements",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-16ab-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.230",
      "values:originalText": "(7) For the purposes of Part IAD (about protecting vulnerable\npersons):\n\n(a) giving evidence includes giving a reading under\nsubsection (4); and\n\n(b) a cross-examination includes a cross-examination under\nsubsection (6).\nNote:\nThis confirms that any protections available under Part IAD will be\navailable for the reading or the cross-examination.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) For the purposes of Part IAD (about protecting vulnerable\npersons):\n\n(a) giving evidence includes giving a reading under\nsubsection (4); and\n\n(b) a cross-examination includes a cross-examination under\nsubsection (6).\nNote:\nThis confirms that any protections available under Part IAD will be\navailable for the reading or the cross-examination.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-16ab"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-16ab-ss-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-16ab-ss-7-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-16ab-ss-7-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1b3152e3f538f0f421f056c56135614c988e04bc5a67797a368666815ab70bc5",
      "skos:note": "Part IAD protections apply to readings and cross-examinations."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-16ab-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "16AB(7) Matters relating to victim impact statements",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 230,
      "values:originalText": "(7) For the purposes of Part IAD (about protecting vulnerable\npersons):\n\n(a) giving evidence includes giving a reading under\nsubsection (4); and\n\n(b) a cross-examination includes a cross-examination under\nsubsection (6).\nNote:\nThis confirms that any protections available under Part IAD will be\navailable for the reading or the cross-examination."
    },
