    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-16ac",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "16AC Reduction for cooperation with law enforcement agencies",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-16ac"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.231",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if a court imposing a sentence, or making an\norder, for a federal offence:\n\n(a) reduces the severity of the sentence or order; or\n\n(b) reduces the non-parole period in relation to the sentence (if\napplicable);\nbecause the offender has undertaken to cooperate with law\nenforcement agencies in proceedings (including confiscation\nproceedings) relating to any offence.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if a court imposing a sentence, or making an\norder, for a federal offence:\n\n(a) reduces the severity of the sentence or order; or\n\n(b) reduces the non-parole period in relation to the sentence (if\napplicable);\nbecause the offender has undertaken to cooperate with law\nenforcement agencies in proceedings (including confiscation\nproceedings) relating to any offence.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-16ac-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-16ac-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a56a5d66db7b4b64dbee95e850c40e52832c8aeaf6db6553cbc01f827c189dce",
      "skos:note": "Cooperation with law enforcement agencies is required for reduced sentence or order."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-16ac",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "16AC Reduction for cooperation with law enforcement agencies",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 231,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if a court imposing a sentence, or making an\norder, for a federal offence:\n\n(a) reduces the severity of the sentence or order; or\n\n(b) reduces the non-parole period in relation to the sentence (if\napplicable);\nbecause the offender has undertaken to cooperate with law\nenforcement agencies in proceedings (including confiscation\nproceedings) relating to any offence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-16ac-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-16ac"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-16ac-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "requires",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Requires cooperation with law enforcement agencies.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-16b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "16B Court to have regard to other periods of imprisonment required",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-16b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.233",
      "values:originalText": "to be served\n\nIn sentencing a person convicted of a federal offence, a court must\nhave regard to:\n\n(a) any sentence already imposed on the person by the court or\nanother court for any other federal offence or for any State or\nTerritory offence, being a sentence that the person has not\nserved; and\n\n(b) any sentence that the person is liable to serve because of the\nrevocation of a parole order made, or licence granted, under\nthis Part or under a law of a State or Territory.",
      "skos:definition": "to be served\n\nIn sentencing a person convicted of a federal offence, a court must\nhave regard to:\n\n(a) any sentence already imposed on the person by the court or\nanother court for any other federal offence or for any State or\nTerritory offence, being a sentence that the person has not\nserved; and\n\n(b) any sentence that the person is liable to serve because of the\nrevocation of a parole order made, or licence granted, under\nthis Part or under a law of a State or Territory.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-16b-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-16b-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "724970d57ef8376a38488dc52a75c5d133cc9e062ef3ef02fed52df06747ca0f",
      "skos:note": "Court must consider previous sentences when sentencing a person convicted of a federal offence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-16b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "16B Court to have regard to other periods of imprisonment required",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 233,
      "values:originalText": "to be served\n\nIn sentencing a person convicted of a federal offence, a court must\nhave regard to:\n\n(a) any sentence already imposed on the person by the court or\nanother court for any other federal offence or for any State or\nTerritory offence, being a sentence that the person has not\nserved; and\n\n(b) any sentence that the person is liable to serve because of the\nrevocation of a parole order made, or licence granted, under\nthis Part or under a law of a State or Territory."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-16b-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-16b"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-16b-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to consider previous sentences",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Court must have regard to...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...consider previous sentences when sentencing a person..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-16ba",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "16BA Taking other offences into account",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-16ba"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.233",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Where a person is convicted of a federal offence or federal\noffences, and the court before which the person is convicted is\nsatisfied that:\n\n(a) there has been filed in the court a document in, or to the\neffect of, the form prescribed for the purposes of this section;\n\n(b) the document contains a list of other federal offences, or\noffences against the law of an external Territory that is\nprescribed for the purposes of this section, which the person\nconvicted is believed to have committed;",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Where a person is convicted of a federal offence or federal\noffences, and the court before which the person is convicted is\nsatisfied that:\n\n(a) there has been filed in the court a document in, or to the\neffect of, the form prescribed for the purposes of this section;\n\n(b) the document contains a list of other federal offences, or\noffences against the law of an external Territory that is\nprescribed for the purposes of this section, which the person\nconvicted is believed to have committed;",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-16ba-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-16ba-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8d9cc7def540f9715301dcfa5c172bff43f5bfc6c1dd119a8cf448383969cd50",
      "skos:note": "Requires filing of document with list of other federal offences."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-16ba",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "16BA Taking other offences into account",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 233,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Where a person is convicted of a federal offence or federal\noffences, and the court before which the person is convicted is\nsatisfied that:\n\n(a) there has been filed in the court a document in, or to the\neffect of, the form prescribed for the purposes of this section;\n\n(b) the document contains a list of other federal offences, or\noffences against the law of an external Territory that is\nprescribed for the purposes of this section, which the person\nconvicted is believed to have committed;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-16ba-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
