      "values:originalText": "(2) Nothing in subsection (1) prevents a court from imposing a fine on\na person because the financial circumstances of the offender cannot\nbe ascertained by the court.\n\n\nSentencing, imprisonment and release of federal offenders  Part IB\nGeneral sentencing principles  Division 2\n\nSection 16D\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026"
    },
