    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19af",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "19AF Non-parole period or pre-release periods not to exceed",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-19af"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.249",
      "values:originalText": "sentence\n\n(1) Where a court is required to fix a non-parole period or make a\nrecognizance release order in respect of a federal sentence or\nsentences, the court must fix a non-parole period that ends, or\nmake a recognizance release order such that the pre-release period\nends, not later than the end of the sentence, or of the last to be\nserved of the sentences.\n\n(2) This section does not restrict the length of the non-parole period or\nthe pre-release period in respect of a life sentence or sentences that\ninclude such a sentence.",
      "skos:definition": "sentence\n\n(1) Where a court is required to fix a non-parole period or make a\nrecognizance release order in respect of a federal sentence or\nsentences, the court must fix a non-parole period that ends, or\nmake a recognizance release order such that the pre-release period\nends, not later than the end of the sentence, or of the last to be\nserved of the sentences.\n\n(2) This section does not restrict the length of the non-parole period or\nthe pre-release period in respect of a life sentence or sentences that\ninclude such a sentence.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19af-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19af-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "821119d79af8b9fcf86d782863d55861708cc4040673f905f9e3b616cfb71199"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-19af",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "19AF Non-parole period or pre-release periods not to exceed",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 249,
      "values:originalText": "sentence\n\n(1) Where a court is required to fix a non-parole period or make a\nrecognizance release order in respect of a federal sentence or\nsentences, the court must fix a non-parole period that ends, or\nmake a recognizance release order such that the pre-release period\nends, not later than the end of the sentence, or of the last to be\nserved of the sentences.\n\n(2) This section does not restrict the length of the non-parole period or\nthe pre-release period in respect of a life sentence or sentences that\ninclude such a sentence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19af-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "19AF(1) Non-parole period or pre-release periods not to exceed",
