    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19ag-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "19AG(3) Non-parole periods for sentences for certain offences",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-19ag-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.250",
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of subsection (2):\n\n(a) a sentence of imprisonment for life for a minimum\nnon-parole offence is taken to be a sentence of imprisonment\nfor 30 years for the offence; and\n\n(b) it does not matter:\n\n(i) whether or not the sentences mentioned in that\nsubsection were imposed at the same sitting; or\n\n(ii) whether or not the convictions giving rise to those\nsentences were at the same sitting; or\n\n(iii) whether or not all the federal sentences mentioned in\nthat subsection are for minimum non-parole offences.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) For the purposes of subsection (2):\n\n(a) a sentence of imprisonment for life for a minimum\nnon-parole offence is taken to be a sentence of imprisonment\nfor 30 years for the offence; and\n\n(b) it does not matter:\n\n(i) whether or not the sentences mentioned in that\nsubsection were imposed at the same sitting; or\n\n(ii) whether or not the convictions giving rise to those\nsentences were at the same sitting; or\n\n(iii) whether or not all the federal sentences mentioned in\nthat subsection are for minimum non-parole offences.",
      "values:partOf": {
