      "cml:premiseText": "(3) A parole order must: (c) if it is proposed that the supervision period for a person released on parole subject to supervision should end before the end of the person’s parole period—specify the day on which the supervision period ends."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19al-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-4",
