      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.261",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Attorney-General must not grant a licence under this section\nunless he or she is satisfied that exceptional circumstances exist\nwhich justify the grant of the licence.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The Attorney-General must not grant a licence under this section\nunless he or she is satisfied that exceptional circumstances exist\nwhich justify the grant of the licence.",
