    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19ap-ss-4a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "19AP(4A) Release on licence",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-19ap-ss-4a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.261",
      "values:originalText": "(4A) Without limiting the matters to which the Attorney-General may\nhave regard for the purposes of subsection (4), the\nAttorney-General may have regard to:\n\n(a) any extensive cooperation by the person with law\nenforcement agencies before sentencing that the sentencing\ncourt did not take into account; or\n\n(b) any extensive cooperation by the person with law\nenforcement agencies after sentencing; or",
      "skos:definition": "(4A) Without limiting the matters to which the Attorney-General may\nhave regard for the purposes of subsection (4), the\nAttorney-General may have regard to:\n\n(a) any extensive cooperation by the person with law\nenforcement agencies before sentencing that the sentencing\ncourt did not take into account; or\n\n(b) any extensive cooperation by the person with law\nenforcement agencies after sentencing; or",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19ap"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19ap-ss-4a-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "89289d820671b680022cca57b11f4a5e1e6eeac58b0bf0ae8c659ae46e81b6da",
      "skos:note": "Attorney-General may have regard to extensive cooperation by the person with law enforcement agencies before or after sentencing."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-19ap-ss-4a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "19AP(4A) Release on licence",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 261,
      "values:originalText": "(4A) Without limiting the matters to which the Attorney-General may\nhave regard for the purposes of subsection (4), the\nAttorney-General may have regard to:\n\n(a) any extensive cooperation by the person with law\nenforcement agencies before sentencing that the sentencing\ncourt did not take into account; or\n\n(b) any extensive cooperation by the person with law\nenforcement agencies after sentencing; or"
    },
    {
