    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19av-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "19AV(3) Arrest of person whose parole order or licence revoked by",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-19av-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.272",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The prescribed authority is not required to fix a non-parole period\nunder paragraph (1)(f) if:\n\n(a) the prescribed authority considers it inappropriate to do so\nbecause of the serious nature of the breach of the conditions\nof the order or licence that led to its revocation; or\n\n(b) the unserved part of the outstanding sentence or sentences is,\nor aggregates, 3 months or less.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The prescribed authority is not required to fix a non-parole period\nunder paragraph (1)(f) if:\n\n(a) the prescribed authority considers it inappropriate to do so\nbecause of the serious nature of the breach of the conditions\nof the order or licence that led to its revocation; or\n\n(b) the unserved part of the outstanding sentence or sentences is,\nor aggregates, 3 months or less.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19av"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19av-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19av-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19av-ss-3-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19av-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19av-ss-3-logic-ltl-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19av-ss-3-logic-deontic-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2dc4bc9d666ccc2e377679d284f742f0697bf1932f7adfce5d8eba87b2a5b714",
      "skos:note": "Authority not required to fix non-parole period under certain conditions. Must be brought before a prescribed authority after arrest."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-19av-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "19AV(3) Arrest of person whose parole order or licence revoked by",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 272,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The prescribed authority is not required to fix a non-parole period\nunder paragraph (1)(f) if:\n\n(a) the prescribed authority considers it inappropriate to do so\nbecause of the serious nature of the breach of the conditions\nof the order or licence that led to its revocation; or\n\n(b) the unserved part of the outstanding sentence or sentences is,\nor aggregates, 3 months or less."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19av-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19av-ss-3"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19av-ss-3-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "exemption",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Authority exempt from fixing non-parole period due to serious breach.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) the prescribed authority considers it inappropriate to do so because of the serious nature of the breach...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The authority is not required to fix a non-parole period under paragraph (1)(f)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19av-ss-3-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "permission",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Authority permitted to deviate from non-parole period requirement.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) the unserved part of the outstanding sentence or sentences is, nor aggregates, 3 months or less.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The authority may fix a non-parole period under paragraph (1)(f) if it is 3 months or less."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19av-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "overlap",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Non-parole period may overlap with other sentence periods.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) the unserved part of the outstanding sentence or sentences is, nor aggregates, 3 months or less.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The non-parole period may overlap with other sentence periods if it is 3 months or less."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19av-ss-3-logic-ltl-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "trace",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Non-parole period requirement applies to certain breaches.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) The prescribed authority is not required to fix a non-parole period under paragraph (1)(f).",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The non-parole period requirement only applies to serious breaches."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19av-ss-3-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to be brought before a prescribed authority.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19av-ss-3a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "19AV(3A) Arrest of person whose parole order or licence revoked by",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-19av-ss-3a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.272",
      "values:originalText": "(3A) Before fixing a non-parole period under paragraph (1)(f) in respect\nof the outstanding sentence or sentences, the prescribed authority\nmust have regard to the period of time spent by the person on\nparole or licence before the parole order or licence was revoked\nunder subsection 19AU(1).",
      "skos:definition": "(3A) Before fixing a non-parole period under paragraph (1)(f) in respect\nof the outstanding sentence or sentences, the prescribed authority\nmust have regard to the period of time spent by the person on\nparole or licence before the parole order or licence was revoked\nunder subsection 19AU(1).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19av"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19av-ss-3a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19av-ss-3a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4df2721958b89cd2ec9bf5087ba9c3cdb0b19ab8241361cfc5278792b6acbe41",
      "skos:note": "Authority must consider parole period before revoking parole order or licence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-19av-ss-3a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "19AV(3A) Arrest of person whose parole order or licence revoked by",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 272,
      "values:originalText": "(3A) Before fixing a non-parole period under paragraph (1)(f) in respect\nof the outstanding sentence or sentences, the prescribed authority\nmust have regard to the period of time spent by the person on\nparole or licence before the parole order or licence was revoked\nunder subsection 19AU(1)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-19av-ss-3a-norm",
