    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20ac-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "20AC(4) Failure to comply with sentence passed, or order made, under",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-20ac-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.296",
      "values:originalText": "(4) A warrant issued under subsection (2) or (3) shall authorize the\napprehension of the person, the bringing of the person before the\ncourt as soon as practicable after his or her apprehension and the\ndetention of the person in custody until he or she is released by\norder of the court or in accordance with subsection (5).",
      "skos:definition": "(4) A warrant issued under subsection (2) or (3) shall authorize the\napprehension of the person, the bringing of the person before the\ncourt as soon as practicable after his or her apprehension and the\ndetention of the person in custody until he or she is released by\norder of the court or in accordance with subsection (5).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20ac"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20ac-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20ac-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "702e2340244fada948ff4abe358d9cf4cada3d79edabb87a69b6e1df5f832178",
      "skos:note": "Detention of person until release by court order or subsection (5) order"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-20ac-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "20AC(4) Failure to comply with sentence passed, or order made, under",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 296,
      "values:originalText": "(4) A warrant issued under subsection (2) or (3) shall authorize the\napprehension of the person, the bringing of the person before the\ncourt as soon as practicable after his or her apprehension and the\ndetention of the person in custody until he or she is released by\norder of the court or in accordance with subsection (5)."
    },
    {
