    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20ac-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "20AC(5) Failure to comply with sentence passed, or order made, under",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-20ac-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.296",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Where a person is apprehended in pursuance of a warrant issued\nunder subsection (2) or (3) and the court before which he or she is\nto be brought is not sitting at the time of his or her arrest, the\nperson shall be brought before a magistrate, who may:\n\n(a) admit the person to bail, on such recognizance (with or\nwithout sureties) as the magistrate thinks fit, on the condition\nthat the person appears, on such date, at such time and at\nsuch place as the magistrate specifies, before that court; or\n\n(b) direct that the person be kept in custody in accordance with\nthe warrant.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Where a person is apprehended in pursuance of a warrant issued\nunder subsection (2) or (3) and the court before which he or she is\nto be brought is not sitting at the time of his or her arrest, the\nperson shall be brought before a magistrate, who may:\n\n(a) admit the person to bail, on such recognizance (with or\nwithout sureties) as the magistrate thinks fit, on the condition\nthat the person appears, on such date, at such time and at\nsuch place as the magistrate specifies, before that court; or\n\n(b) direct that the person be kept in custody in accordance with\nthe warrant.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20ac"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20ac-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20ac-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bc8396ab7b6abf6bdf5a681efc649a74a51be78f2c501e4267acf78d538dfed9",
      "skos:note": "Person must appear before court on specified date and time after being admitted to bail."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-20ac-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "20AC(5) Failure to comply with sentence passed, or order made, under",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 296,
      "values:originalText": "(5) Where a person is apprehended in pursuance of a warrant issued\nunder subsection (2) or (3) and the court before which he or she is\nto be brought is not sitting at the time of his or her arrest, the\nperson shall be brought before a magistrate, who may:\n\n(a) admit the person to bail, on such recognizance (with or\nwithout sureties) as the magistrate thinks fit, on the condition\nthat the person appears, on such date, at such time and at\nsuch place as the magistrate specifies, before that court; or\n\n(b) direct that the person be kept in custody in accordance with\nthe warrant."
    },
    {
