        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.300",
      "values:originalText": "(6) For the purposes of subsection (3), a prima facie case is established\nif there is evidence that would (except for the circumstances by\nreason of which the person is unfit to be tried) provide sufficient\ngrounds to put the person on trial in relation to the offence.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) For the purposes of subsection (3), a prima facie case is established\nif there is evidence that would (except for the circumstances by\nreason of which the person is unfit to be tried) provide sufficient\ngrounds to put the person on trial in relation to the offence.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20b-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20b-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20b-ss-6-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20b-ss-6-logic-argumentation-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1c2b25e73e0501fb458110a6c33ff3023700fbb4c89f2cb56f1a8f2d69443cc3",
      "skos:note": "Establishes prima facie case for trial based on evidence"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-20b-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "20B(6) Consequences of preliminary finding that person unfit to be",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 300,
      "values:originalText": "(6) For the purposes of subsection (3), a prima facie case is established\nif there is evidence that would (except for the circumstances by\nreason of which the person is unfit to be tried) provide sufficient\ngrounds to put the person on trial in relation to the offence."
    },
    {
