      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20ba",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "20BA Upon determining prima facie case, court to dismiss charge or",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-20ba"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.301",
      "values:originalText": "to determine fitness within 12 months\n\n(1) Where the court determines that there has not been established a\nprima facie case that the person committed the offence, the court\nmust, by order, dismiss the charge against the person and, if the\nperson is in custody, order the release of the person from custody.\n\n(2) Where the court determines that there has been established a prima\nfacie case that the person committed the offence, but the court is of\nthe opinion, having regard to:\n\n(a) the character, antecedents, age, health or mental condition of\nthe person; or",
      "skos:definition": "to determine fitness within 12 months\n\n(1) Where the court determines that there has not been established a\nprima facie case that the person committed the offence, the court\nmust, by order, dismiss the charge against the person and, if the\nperson is in custody, order the release of the person from custody.\n\n(2) Where the court determines that there has been established a prima\nfacie case that the person committed the offence, but the court is of\nthe opinion, having regard to:\n\n(a) the character, antecedents, age, health or mental condition of\nthe person; or",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20ba-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20ba-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8105119dd253d459891af2566885a2f8ce7dae24d58c3663055e2c59b65d5927"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-20ba",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "20BA Upon determining prima facie case, court to dismiss charge or",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 301,
      "values:originalText": "to determine fitness within 12 months\n\n(1) Where the court determines that there has not been established a\nprima facie case that the person committed the offence, the court\nmust, by order, dismiss the charge against the person and, if the\nperson is in custody, order the release of the person from custody.\n\n(2) Where the court determines that there has been established a prima\nfacie case that the person committed the offence, but the court is of\nthe opinion, having regard to:\n\n(a) the character, antecedents, age, health or mental condition of\nthe person; or"
    },
