      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.307",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Attorney-General must not order a person’s release from\ndetention unless the Attorney-General is satisfied that the person is\nnot a threat or danger either to himself or herself or to the\ncommunity.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Attorney-General must not order a person’s release from\ndetention unless the Attorney-General is satisfied that the person is\nnot a threat or danger either to himself or herself or to the\ncommunity.",
