      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.307",
      "values:originalText": "(3) An order:\n\n(a) must be in writing; and\n\n(b) remains in force for such period as is specified in the order\n(being a period equal to the balance of the period fixed by the\ncourt for detention under subsection 20BC(2)) or for a period\nof 5 years, whichever is the lesser; and\n\n(c) is subject to such conditions (if any) as are specified in the\norder.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) An order:\n\n(a) must be in writing; and\n\n(b) remains in force for such period as is specified in the order\n(being a period equal to the balance of the period fixed by the\ncourt for detention under subsection 20BC(2)) or for a period\nof 5 years, whichever is the lesser; and\n\n(c) is subject to such conditions (if any) as are specified in the\norder.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20be"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
