    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20be-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "20BE(4) Attorney-General may order release",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-20be-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.307",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Without limiting the generality of paragraph (3)(c), the conditions\nthat may be specified in the order may include all or any of the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) a condition that the person reside at an address specified in\nthe order;\n\n(b) a condition that the person present himself or herself for such\nmedical or psychiatric treatment as is specified in the order at\nsuch times as are specified in the order;\n\n(c) a condition that the person undertake such medical or mental\nhealth therapy as is specified in the order;",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Without limiting the generality of paragraph (3)(c), the conditions\nthat may be specified in the order may include all or any of the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) a condition that the person reside at an address specified in\nthe order;\n\n(b) a condition that the person present himself or herself for such\nmedical or psychiatric treatment as is specified in the order at\nsuch times as are specified in the order;\n\n(c) a condition that the person undertake such medical or mental\nhealth therapy as is specified in the order;",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20be"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20be-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20be-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "76256576907dea0765eb0fb2e6c6f64959eb657c4c784aec2cc5bf8a89703003",
      "skos:note": "Conditions for release order"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-20be-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "20BE(4) Attorney-General may order release",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 307,
      "values:originalText": "(4) Without limiting the generality of paragraph (3)(c), the conditions\nthat may be specified in the order may include all or any of the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) a condition that the person reside at an address specified in\nthe order;\n\n(b) a condition that the person present himself or herself for such\nmedical or psychiatric treatment as is specified in the order at\nsuch times as are specified in the order;\n\n(c) a condition that the person undertake such medical or mental\nhealth therapy as is specified in the order;"
    },
    {
