        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(5) Subject to subsection (6), where a prescribed authority in a State or Territory before whom a person is brought under subsection (4) is satisfied that...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...the warrant: ..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20bf-ss-5-logic-deontic-4",
