      "values:originalText": "(2) Subsection 20BD(2) and, subject to the modification set out in\nsubsection (3), section 20BE, apply in relation to an initial\nconsideration and to any reconsideration under subsection (1).",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Subsection 20BD(2) and, subject to the modification set out in\nsubsection (3), section 20BE, apply in relation to an initial\nconsideration and to any reconsideration under subsection (1).",
