      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.310",
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of applying section 20BE, subsection 20BE(1)\nhas effect as if the reference in that subsection to\nsubsection 20BD(1) were a reference to subsection (1) of this\nsection.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) For the purposes of applying section 20BE, subsection 20BE(1)\nhas effect as if the reference in that subsection to\nsubsection 20BD(1) were a reference to subsection (1) of this\nsection.",
      "values:partOf": {
