      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.321",
      "values:originalText": "(3) A court must not specify a period of detention in a hospital that is\nlonger than the period of imprisonment to which the person would\nhave been sentenced had the hospital order not been made.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A court must not specify a period of detention in a hospital that is\nlonger than the period of imprisonment to which the person would\nhave been sentenced had the hospital order not been made.",
