      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.324",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The court may, on the application of the person, of the probation\nofficer appointed to supervise the person or of the person in charge\nof the hospital or other place where the treatment is being\nundertaken, vary the treatment that the person is to undertake.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The court may, on the application of the person, of the probation\nofficer appointed to supervise the person or of the person in charge\nof the hospital or other place where the treatment is being\nundertaken, vary the treatment that the person is to undertake.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20bv"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20bv-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20bv-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "686b92ea5b4ed26fbdeadb2d00d1c3872cfaff611578ad76e5dd6509eba71505",
      "skos:note": "Court may vary treatment under certain conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-20bv-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "20BV(4) Psychiatric probation orders",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 324,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The court may, on the application of the person, of the probation\nofficer appointed to supervise the person or of the person in charge\nof the hospital or other place where the treatment is being\nundertaken, vary the treatment that the person is to undertake."
    },
