    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20bw",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "20BW Breach of psychiatric probation orders",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-20bw"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.325",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Where an order has been made under section 20BV and\ninformation is laid before a magistrate, whether before or after the\nend of the period referred to in paragraph 20BV(3)(a) or (b),\nalleging that the person has, without reasonable excuse, failed to\ncomply with a condition of the order, the magistrate may:",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Where an order has been made under section 20BV and\ninformation is laid before a magistrate, whether before or after the\nend of the period referred to in paragraph 20BV(3)(a) or (b),\nalleging that the person has, without reasonable excuse, failed to\ncomply with a condition of the order, the magistrate may:",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20bw-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20bw-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1fc06203d139ac4ffeb7260144883e8405e924e5efe9a461a871ae07568f82b1",
      "skos:note": "Magistrate may take action if person fails to comply with condition of order."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-20bw",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "20BW Breach of psychiatric probation orders",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 325,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Where an order has been made under section 20BV and\ninformation is laid before a magistrate, whether before or after the\nend of the period referred to in paragraph 20BV(3)(a) or (b),\nalleging that the person has, without reasonable excuse, failed to\ncomply with a condition of the order, the magistrate may:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20bw-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-20bw"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
