      "values:originalText": "(2) Where a person who is subject to an order under section 20BV is\ndealt with under subsection (1) for the offence in respect of which\nthe order was made, the court must, in so dealing with the person,\nin addition to any other matters, take into account:\n\n(a) the fact that the order was made; and\n\n(b) anything done under the order; and\n\n(c) any other order made in respect of the offence.",
