      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.335",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Nothing in this Part shall be construed as affecting the powers\nvested in the Governor-General in the exercise of the Royal\nprerogative of mercy.\n\n(2) This Part does not affect the operation of any other law of the\nCommonwealth, or of any law in force in a Territory, relating to\nthe release of offenders.",
