    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-22-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "22(7) Conditions etc. that a court may impose on certain offenders",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-22-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.336",
      "values:originalText": "(7) In this section:\nrelevant order means an order:\n\n(a) remanding a person, whether on bail or in custody; or\n\n(b) suspending the sentence passed on a person upon his or her\nentering into a recognizance; or\n\n(c) releasing the person on conditions under subsection 20(1).\nrelevant sentence means:\n\n(a) a sentence of imprisonment other than a suspended sentence;\nor\n\n(b) a sentence under section 20AB.\nserious drug offence means an offence:\n\n(a) involving, or relating to, controlled substances; and",
      "skos:definition": "(7) In this section:\nrelevant order means an order:\n\n(a) remanding a person, whether on bail or in custody; or\n\n(b) suspending the sentence passed on a person upon his or her\nentering into a recognizance; or\n\n(c) releasing the person on conditions under subsection 20(1).\nrelevant sentence means:\n\n(a) a sentence of imprisonment other than a suspended sentence;\nor\n\n(b) a sentence under section 20AB.\nserious drug offence means an offence:\n\n(a) involving, or relating to, controlled substances; and",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-22"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-22-ss-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-22-ss-7-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-22-ss-7-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4f82e5eb1e2977b5edd2df0709574dbd70f3e5fae7c6bac16dce7bec28db5494",
      "skos:note": "Court may impose conditions on certain offenders"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-22-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "22(7) Conditions etc. that a court may impose on certain offenders",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 336,
      "values:originalText": "(7) In this section:\nrelevant order means an order:\n\n(a) remanding a person, whether on bail or in custody; or\n\n(b) suspending the sentence passed on a person upon his or her\nentering into a recognizance; or\n\n(c) releasing the person on conditions under subsection 20(1).\nrelevant sentence means:\n\n(a) a sentence of imprisonment other than a suspended sentence;\nor\n\n(b) a sentence under section 20AB.\nserious drug offence means an offence:\n\n(a) involving, or relating to, controlled substances; and"
    },
