      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "23 Outline of this Part",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.339",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This Part:\n\n(a) provides for the detention of people arrested for\nCommonwealth offences (see Division 2); and\n\n(b) imposes obligations on investigating officials in relation to:\n\n(i) people arrested for Commonwealth offences; and\n\n(ii) certain other people who are being investigated for\nCommonwealth offences;\n\n(see Division 3).\n\n(2) To avoid doubt, this Part does not confer any power to arrest a\nperson.\n\n(3) To avoid doubt, only a person arrested for a Commonwealth\noffence may be detained under this Part.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This Part:\n\n(a) provides for the detention of people arrested for\nCommonwealth offences (see Division 2); and\n\n(b) imposes obligations on investigating officials in relation to:\n\n(i) people arrested for Commonwealth offences; and\n\n(ii) certain other people who are being investigated for\nCommonwealth offences;\n\n(see Division 3).\n\n(2) To avoid doubt, this Part does not confer any power to arrest a\nperson.\n\n(3) To avoid doubt, only a person arrested for a Commonwealth\noffence may be detained under this Part.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2b761d29b3919bc4b69966dbf3c29b11b09b828bcb75e5f0c1fc1c927b3b2aeb"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23 Outline of this Part",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 339,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This Part:\n\n(a) provides for the detention of people arrested for\nCommonwealth offences (see Division 2); and\n\n(b) imposes obligations on investigating officials in relation to:\n\n(i) people arrested for Commonwealth offences; and\n\n(ii) certain other people who are being investigated for\nCommonwealth offences;\n\n(see Division 3).\n\n(2) To avoid doubt, this Part does not confer any power to arrest a\nperson.\n\n(3) To avoid doubt, only a person arrested for a Commonwealth\noffence may be detained under this Part."
    },
