    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23c-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "23C(6) Period of investigation if arrested for a non-terrorism offence",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23c-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.346",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If the person has been arrested more than once within any period of\n48 hours, the investigation period for each arrest other than the first\nis reduced by so much of any of the following periods as occurred\nwithin that 48 hours:\n\n(a) any earlier investigation period or periods under this section;\n\n(b) any earlier investigation period or periods under\nsection 23DB.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If the person has been arrested more than once within any period of\n48 hours, the investigation period for each arrest other than the first\nis reduced by so much of any of the following periods as occurred\nwithin that 48 hours:\n\n(a) any earlier investigation period or periods under this section;\n\n(b) any earlier investigation period or periods under\nsection 23DB.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23c"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23c-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23c-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8b7ff969e1212491804200aec66490931a4b9bdbdcdc0a2fc0b380fa8d948200",
      "skos:note": "Reduction of investigation period for repeated arrests within 48 hours"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23c-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23C(6) Period of investigation if arrested for a non-terrorism offence",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 346,
      "values:originalText": "(6) If the person has been arrested more than once within any period of\n48 hours, the investigation period for each arrest other than the first\nis reduced by so much of any of the following periods as occurred\nwithin that 48 hours:\n\n(a) any earlier investigation period or periods under this section;\n\n(b) any earlier investigation period or periods under\nsection 23DB."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23c-ss-6-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23c-ss-6"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23c-ss-6-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibition",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibits repeated arrests within 48 hours",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(6) If the person has been arrested more than once..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23c-ss-6a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "23C(6A) Period of investigation if arrested for a non-terrorism offence",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23c-ss-6a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.346",
      "values:originalText": "(6A) However, in relation to each first arrest, disregard subsection (6)\nfor any later arrest if:\n\n(a) the later arrest is for a Commonwealth offence:\n\n(i) that was committed after the end of the person’s period\nof detention under this Part for the first arrest; or\n\n(ii) that arose in different circumstances to those in which\nany Commonwealth offence to which the first arrest\nrelates arose, and for which new evidence has been\nfound since the first arrest; and\n\n(b) the person’s questioning associated with the later arrest does\nnot relate to:\n\n(i) a Commonwealth offence to which the first arrest\nrelates; or\n\n(ii) the circumstances in which such an offence was\ncommitted.",
      "skos:definition": "(6A) However, in relation to each first arrest, disregard subsection (6)\nfor any later arrest if:\n\n(a) the later arrest is for a Commonwealth offence:\n\n(i) that was committed after the end of the person’s period\nof detention under this Part for the first arrest; or\n\n(ii) that arose in different circumstances to those in which\nany Commonwealth offence to which the first arrest\nrelates arose, and for which new evidence has been\nfound since the first arrest; and\n\n(b) the person’s questioning associated with the later arrest does\nnot relate to:\n\n(i) a Commonwealth offence to which the first arrest\nrelates; or\n\n(ii) the circumstances in which such an offence was\ncommitted.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23c"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23c-ss-6a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23c-ss-6a-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23c-ss-6a-logic-linearlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23c-ss-6a-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23c-ss-6a-logic-linearlogic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "21876ad86af7ba67cb8ef215db4f35723b29ce503d6361e6280a60d6e0016ef5",
      "skos:note": "Disregard subsection (6) for any later arrest if certain conditions are met."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23c-ss-6a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23C(6A) Period of investigation if arrested for a non-terrorism offence",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 346,
      "values:originalText": "(6A) However, in relation to each first arrest, disregard subsection (6)\nfor any later arrest if:\n\n(a) the later arrest is for a Commonwealth offence:\n\n(i) that was committed after the end of the person’s period\nof detention under this Part for the first arrest; or\n\n(ii) that arose in different circumstances to those in which\nany Commonwealth offence to which the first arrest\nrelates arose, and for which new evidence has been\nfound since the first arrest; and\n\n(b) the person’s questioning associated with the later arrest does\nnot relate to:\n\n(i) a Commonwealth offence to which the first arrest\nrelates; or\n\n(ii) the circumstances in which such an offence was\ncommitted."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23c-ss-6a-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23c-ss-6a"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23c-ss-6a-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to disregard subsection (6)",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The state is obligated to disregard subsection (6) for any later arrest if certain conditions are met.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Subsection (6) should be disregarded."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23c-ss-6a-logic-linearlogic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LinearLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Conjunction",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Conjunction: Subsection (6) and Obligation to disregard subsection (6)",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::linear",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Subsection (6) is a subclass of Obligation to disregard subsection (6).",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Subsection (6) and Obligation to disregard subsection (6) are true."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23c-ss-6a-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Permission",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Permission to disregard subsection (6)",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The state is permitted to disregard subsection (6) for any later arrest if certain conditions are met.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Subsection (6) may be disregarded."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23c-ss-6a-logic-linearlogic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LinearLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Disjunction",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Disjunction: Subsection (6) or Obligation to disregard subsection (6)",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::linear",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Subsection (6) is a subclass of Obligation to disregard subsection (6).",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Subsection (6) or Obligation to disregard subsection (6) are true."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23c-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "23C(7) Period of investigation if arrested for a non-terrorism offence",
