    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23da-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23DA(5) Magistrate may extend investigation period",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 350,
      "values:originalText": "(5) The magistrate must:\n\n(a) give the investigating official a copy of the instrument as\nsoon as practicable after signing it; and\n\n(b) if the instrument was made as a result of an application made\nby telephone, telex, fax or other electronic means—inform"
    },
    {
