    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23db-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23DB(7) Period of investigation if arrested for a terrorism offence",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 352,
      "values:originalText": "(7) If the person has been arrested more than once within any period of\n48 hours, the investigation period for each arrest other than the first\nis reduced by so much of any of the following periods as occurred\nwithin that 48 hours:\n\n(a) any earlier investigation period or periods under this section;\n\n(b) any earlier investigation period or periods under section 23C."
    },
