    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23db-ss-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "23DB(8) Period of investigation if arrested for a terrorism offence",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23db-ss-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.352",
      "values:originalText": "(8) However, in relation to each first arrest, disregard subsection (7)\nfor any later arrest if:\n\n(a) the later arrest is for a Commonwealth offence:\n\n(i) that was committed after the end of the person’s period\nof detention under this Part for the first arrest; or\n\n(ii) that arose in different circumstances to those in which\nany Commonwealth offence to which the first arrest\nrelates arose, and for which new evidence has been\nfound since the first arrest; and\n\n(b) the person’s questioning associated with the later arrest does\nnot relate to:",
      "skos:definition": "(8) However, in relation to each first arrest, disregard subsection (7)\nfor any later arrest if:\n\n(a) the later arrest is for a Commonwealth offence:\n\n(i) that was committed after the end of the person’s period\nof detention under this Part for the first arrest; or\n\n(ii) that arose in different circumstances to those in which\nany Commonwealth offence to which the first arrest\nrelates arose, and for which new evidence has been\nfound since the first arrest; and\n\n(b) the person’s questioning associated with the later arrest does\nnot relate to:",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23db"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23db-ss-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23db-ss-8-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0b944f4939b33b605b6220c9c3a9ce6dd416d3c7f617878320c332ed906b1072",
      "skos:note": "Disregard subsection (7) for any later arrest if certain conditions are met."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23db-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23DB(8) Period of investigation if arrested for a terrorism offence",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 352,
      "values:originalText": "(8) However, in relation to each first arrest, disregard subsection (7)\nfor any later arrest if:\n\n(a) the later arrest is for a Commonwealth offence:\n\n(i) that was committed after the end of the person’s period\nof detention under this Part for the first arrest; or\n\n(ii) that arose in different circumstances to those in which\nany Commonwealth offence to which the first arrest\nrelates arose, and for which new evidence has been\nfound since the first arrest; and\n\n(b) the person’s questioning associated with the later arrest does\nnot relate to:"
    },
