      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) a person is arrested for a terrorism offence; and\n\n(b) an investigation is being conducted into whether the person\ncommitted that terrorism offence or another terrorism\noffence.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The period during which suspension or delay of questioning may not be applied starts when the investigation is completed and ends at the end of the relevant temporal interval."
    },
    {
