      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) a person is arrested for a terrorism offence; and\n(b) an investigation is being conducted into whether the person\ncommitted that terrorism offence or another terrorism\noffence.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The obligation applies if both conditions are met."
    },
    {
