      "cml:premiseText": "(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) a person is arrested for a terrorism offence; and\n\n(b) an application has been made under subsection 23DC(2) to a\nmagistrate in respect of the person.\nSpecification of period"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23dd-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "23DD(2) Time during which suspension or delay of questioning may be",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23dd-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.358",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The magistrate may, by signed instrument, specify a period starting\nat the time the instrument is signed, if satisfied that:\n\n(a) it is appropriate to do so, having regard to:\n\n(i) the application; and\n\n(ii) the representations (if any) made by the person, or his or\nher legal representative, about the application; and\n\n(iii) any other relevant matters; and\n\n(b) the offence is a terrorism offence; and\n\n(c) detention of the person is necessary to preserve or obtain\nevidence or to complete the investigation into the offence or\ninto another terrorism offence; and\n\n\nInvestigation of Commonwealth offences  Part IC\nPowers of detention  Division 2\n\nSection 23DD\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(d) the investigation into the offence is being conducted properly\nand without delay; and\n\n(e) the application has been authorised by an authorising officer;\nand\n\n(f) the person, or his or her legal representative, has been given\nthe opportunity to make representations about the\napplication.\nInstrument specifying period",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The magistrate may, by signed instrument, specify a period starting\nat the time the instrument is signed, if satisfied that:\n\n(a) it is appropriate to do so, having regard to:\n\n(i) the application; and\n\n(ii) the representations (if any) made by the person, or his or\nher legal representative, about the application; and\n\n(iii) any other relevant matters; and\n\n(b) the offence is a terrorism offence; and\n\n(c) detention of the person is necessary to preserve or obtain\nevidence or to complete the investigation into the offence or\ninto another terrorism offence; and\n\n\nInvestigation of Commonwealth offences  Part IC\nPowers of detention  Division 2\n\nSection 23DD\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(d) the investigation into the offence is being conducted properly\nand without delay; and\n\n(e) the application has been authorised by an authorising officer;\nand\n\n(f) the person, or his or her legal representative, has been given\nthe opportunity to make representations about the\napplication.\nInstrument specifying period",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23dd"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23dd-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a09366278bcc2a28698f0f7af7489867ae8b535eb68651892243e464f18b4e80",
      "skos:note": "The magistrate may specify a period for suspension or delay of questioning."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23dd-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23DD(2) Time during which suspension or delay of questioning may be",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 358,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The magistrate may, by signed instrument, specify a period starting\nat the time the instrument is signed, if satisfied that:\n\n(a) it is appropriate to do so, having regard to:\n\n(i) the application; and\n\n(ii) the representations (if any) made by the person, or his or\nher legal representative, about the application; and\n\n(iii) any other relevant matters; and\n\n(b) the offence is a terrorism offence; and\n\n(c) detention of the person is necessary to preserve or obtain\nevidence or to complete the investigation into the offence or\ninto another terrorism offence; and\n\n\nInvestigation of Commonwealth offences  Part IC\nPowers of detention  Division 2\n\nSection 23DD\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(d) the investigation into the offence is being conducted properly\nand without delay; and\n\n(e) the application has been authorised by an authorising officer;\nand\n\n(f) the person, or his or her legal representative, has been given\nthe opportunity to make representations about the\napplication.\nInstrument specifying period"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23dd-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23dd-ss-2"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23dd-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "23DD(3) Time during which suspension or delay of questioning may be",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23dd-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.358",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Subject to subsection (4), the instrument must:\n\n(a) specify the period as a number (which may be less than one)\nof hours; and\n\n(b) set out the day and time when it was signed; and\n\n(c) set out the reasons for specifying the period.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Subject to subsection (4), the instrument must:\n\n(a) specify the period as a number (which may be less than one)\nof hours; and\n\n(b) set out the day and time when it was signed; and\n\n(c) set out the reasons for specifying the period.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23dd"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23dd-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23dd-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "60fd72f89924322614b7addd3df0a4e8a31d87ae6b65c138a552b06393c1c84b",
      "skos:note": "Specify period, day and time of signing, and reasons for specifying the period.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23dd-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23DD(3) Time during which suspension or delay of questioning may be",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 358,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Subject to subsection (4), the instrument must:\n\n(a) specify the period as a number (which may be less than one)\nof hours; and\n\n(b) set out the day and time when it was signed; and\n\n(c) set out the reasons for specifying the period."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23dd-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23dd-ss-3"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23dd-ss-3-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Specify period",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
