      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23dd-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "23DD(4) Time during which suspension or delay of questioning may be",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23dd-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.358",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Subsection (3) does not require any information to be included in\nthe instrument if disclosure of that information is likely:\n\n(a) to prejudice national security (within the meaning of the\nNational Security Information (Criminal and Civil\nProceedings) Act 2004); or\n\n(b) to be protected by public interest immunity; or\n\n(c) to put at risk ongoing operations by law enforcement\nagencies or intelligence agencies; or\n\n(d) to put at risk the safety of the community, law enforcement\nofficers or intelligence officers.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Subsection (3) does not require any information to be included in\nthe instrument if disclosure of that information is likely:\n\n(a) to prejudice national security (within the meaning of the\nNational Security Information (Criminal and Civil\nProceedings) Act 2004); or\n\n(b) to be protected by public interest immunity; or\n\n(c) to put at risk ongoing operations by law enforcement\nagencies or intelligence agencies; or\n\n(d) to put at risk the safety of the community, law enforcement\nofficers or intelligence officers.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23dd"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23dd-ss-4-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7b488298b48925f83945741c3208219407ce91bc08a559b06dcc3425e896a331",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of certain information is not required."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-23dd-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23DD(4) Time during which suspension or delay of questioning may be",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 358,
      "values:originalText": "(4) Subsection (3) does not require any information to be included in\nthe instrument if disclosure of that information is likely:\n\n(a) to prejudice national security (within the meaning of the\nNational Security Information (Criminal and Civil\nProceedings) Act 2004); or\n\n(b) to be protected by public interest immunity; or\n\n(c) to put at risk ongoing operations by law enforcement\nagencies or intelligence agencies; or\n\n(d) to put at risk the safety of the community, law enforcement\nofficers or intelligence officers."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-23dd-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
