      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.363",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the form of the instrument completed by the investigating\nofficial does not, in all material respects, accord with the terms of\nthe instrument signed by the magistrate, the instrument is taken to\nhave had no effect.",
